window.HANDBUCH_INDEX=[{"p":"index.html","a":"","t":"欢迎","s":"欢迎","x":"在 BehavEd-Remake 中打开的 yavin1 自制任务:右侧是脚本,中间是地图,下方是时间轴。 游戏使用 ICARUS 脚本来运行场景:一系列命令,例如“走到这个位置”、“播放这个声音”、“把摄像机移到那里”。Raven 原版 BehavEd 让你用按钮搭建这些命令。BehavEd-Remake 做同样的事,文件完全兼容,并加入了原版没有的功能:三维地图、沿路径行走的角色、按镜头飞行的摄像机,以及能把这一切播放出来的时间轴——在你启动游戏之前就能看到。"},{"p":"index.html","a":"wege","t":"欢迎","s":"从哪里开始","x":"第一次使用?先阅读  和 ——十分钟后,其余页面都会变得容易理解。 想马上动手?选择下面的一个教程。 在找某个功能?在左上角的搜索框中输入——它会搜索所有页面并跳转到对应位置。"},{"p":"index.html","a":"tutorials","t":"欢迎","s":"教程","x":"Besides the big mission there are 63 short tutorials - each shows one thing in three to six steps. All of them, with pictures: . Scripts                   Camera and timeline            Figures         Map and entities             Animation   Missions, models and settings            "},{"p":"index.html","a":"kann","t":"欢迎","s":"程序能做什么","x":" 从命令列表构建脚本,在对话框中编辑每个值,复制、移动、撤销——与原版 BehavEd 相同。  以树、以“谁启动谁”的关系图,或以时间轨道的形式查看脚本。  带光照、特效和模型的三维地图;在其中飞行,选择并移动实体。  摄像机镜头作为地图上的关键帧:用操纵器移动和旋转,亲自驾驶,实时预览。  播放场景,查看每个命令的时间位置,拖动命令以改变其发生时间。  行走角色与飞行飞船的路径:起点和终点控制柄、新增路径点、步行或奔跑、朝向。  为飞船、门和平台制作动画——生成 move 命令或 ROFF 文件,直接在这里创建和编辑。  打开包含全部脚本的完整任务,创建自己的任务,并打包成游戏可加载的 .pk3。 不会丢失任何内容。 每次修改都可以用 Ctrl+Z 撤销,只有保存时才会写入文件。游戏本身的文件永远不会被修改:新内容会放在你的脚本旁边或你自己的 .pk3 中。"},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"What BehavEd can do","x":"BehavEd-Remake writes ICARUS scripts - the scripts behind every cutscene and every scripted moment of Jedi Academy and its mods. It writes them exactly like Raven's original BehavEd, file for file, and then shows you what they do: on the map, in 3D, over time. Each section below links to the tutorials that practise it."},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"skripte","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"Write scripts like the original","x":"The command list, the script tree and the action column. Every command of the game in one list - double-click, drag or press Insert to add it.  Each value in its own field: lists of allowed values, names picked from the map, sounds you can play, expressions with get, tag and random.  Copy, move, comment out, undo every step - even one single step from the middle of the history. ,  Compile to the .ibi the game runs, with clear messages that jump to the wrong line.  Every command and every SET_ field explained: ."},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"ansichten","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"Three views of the same script","x":"Graph: what starts what. Tracks: the script over time. 经典 is the tree of the original. 图表 shows the mission as nodes - the player start, runners, characters, scripts - and lets you connect them by dragging. 轨道 lays the script out over time, with the camera, every figure and the dialogue in rows. , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"karte","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"The map in 3D - as the game draws it","x":"The landing pad of taspir1 with the mission's entities. Maps load straight from the game's .pk3 files, with their shaders, lightmaps, fog, glow, effects, sky portals and mirrors. Fly through them, look from above, save views on number keys. Place entities with tiles, drag and turn them on the grid, edit every key in the inspector. , , , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"kamera","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"Cameras you can see and fly","x":"A camera path played through the camera. Each camera ( MOVE ) and PAN is a shot on the map with its path. Move and turn shots with the gizmo, put them where you are looking, or sit in a shot and fly it in pilot mode. Zoom, fade, shake and follow play in the view exactly as in the game. , , , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"figuren","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"Figures that walk their paths","x":"A figure in the middle of its walk, with its path. Characters spawn with their real models and animations and walk where the script sends them. Their paths have handles: drag a walk target, insert a point mid-walk, switch walk, run or walk backwards, set where a figure looks and which way it faces. , , , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"zeit","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"A timeline for the whole scene","x":"Dragging a block in the timeline: everything after it moves along. Play the scene with sound, at any speed. Every command is a block in time - drag it and everything after moves along, drag its edge to change a duration. , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"animation","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"Animation: move commands and ROFF files","x":"The Raven's Claw taking off on a ROFF path. Set keys over time for a door, a platform or a ship. behaved writes them as move commands or builds a ROFF file, and it turns the game's own ROFF files into keys you can change - as a copy, never touching the original. , , , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"missionen","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"Missions: from nothing to a .pk3","x":"Saving a mission: every file, every check. Start a mission on any map with one click, open the missions of the game or a mod, continue them from their folder. 保存任务 checks everything, compiles every script and packs one .pk3 with map, entities, scripts and ROFF files - ready for devmap. NPC waypoint networks are created and checked on the way. , , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"modell","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"Character models and their animations","x":"A character in the model view, with its animation list. Every character of the game with its skin, every animation with its frames - click to play, double-click to put it into the script. , , "},{"p":"funktionen.html","a":"werkzeuge","t":"What BehavEd can do","s":"The tools around it","x":"Find and replace in one script or in all open ones.  Tabs, bookmarks and a split view to compare scripts and copy across.  Backups on every save, a backup folder, revert any command to how it was.  Four languages, six themes, any interface size, every shortcut rebindable. ,  Checks for updates and installs them. "},{"p":"erste-schritte.html","a":"","t":"快速上手","s":"快速上手","x":""},{"p":"erste-schritte.html","a":"installieren","t":"快速上手","s":"安装","x":"从发布页面下载最新的 BehavEd-Remake-….zip,解压到任意文件夹,例如游戏旁边。不会向 Windows 安装任何东西。 启动 behaved.exe。程序启动时会在 GitHub 上检查新版本并提示你;未经同意不会下载任何内容(开关位于 帮助)。"},{"p":"erste-schritte.html","a":"spielordner","t":"快速上手","s":"指定游戏文件夹","x":"地图、模型、声音和游戏脚本都在游戏的 .pk3 压缩包中。打开 编辑 → 游戏目录,用 添加游戏目录… 添加游戏文件夹:先 base,再添加模组,例如 Movie Duels(MD)。最下面的文件夹优先,正如游戏中 fs_game 覆盖 base。 游戏文件夹:先 base,模组在其下方——最下面的优先。"},{"p":"erste-schritte.html","a":"oeffnen","t":"快速上手","s":"打开内容","x":"有多种打开方式。地图页的起始页面(未打开地图时显示)提供:新建任务、从 .pk3 打开任务、只打开地图,以及最近的任务。在菜单中: 任务——文件 → 加载任务… 选择一个 .pk3,打开任务及其地图、实体和全部脚本(每个脚本一个标签页)。参见 。 脚本——文件 → 打开 从磁盘打开 .txt 或已编译的 .ibi。 最近的任务——文件 → 最近的任务 一键重新打开整个任务。 未打开地图时,“任务”标签页显示起始页面。"},{"p":"erste-schritte.html","a":"sprache","t":"快速上手","s":"语言","x":"程序支持英语、德语、中文和日语。启动时使用 Windows 的语言,可在 视图 → 语言 中更改。命令名和值保持游戏中的写法(affect、SET_NAVGOAL),因为文件中就是这样写的。 本手册可通过 F1、帮助 → 手册与教程、起始页面上的 入门 和 教程 打开,也可在 关于 BehavEd 中点击 手册 按钮。它位于 behaved.exe 旁边的 handbuch 文件夹中,无需联网。"},{"p":"fenster.html","a":"","t":"窗口","s":"窗口","x":"打开任务后处于“任务”标签页的窗口。"},{"p":"fenster.html","a":"bereiche","t":"窗口","s":"各个区域","x":"菜单栏 文件、编辑、调试、视图、帮助——打开与保存、游戏文件夹、外观与语言、本手册。 脚本标签页 每个打开的脚本一个标签页。* 表示有未保存的修改,+ 新建脚本,标签页可拖动排序。同一任务的所有标签页共享地图和摄像机。 模式栏 最左侧的竖条:事件(构建脚本)、任务(三维地图)、模型(查看角色模型)。 左栏 取决于模式:命令列表、地图实体及其检查器,或模型的动画列表。 脚本流程 脚本本身——以树(经典)、关系图(图表)或时间轨道(轨道)显示。参见 。 操作 右侧的按钮栏,与原版一致:编辑、文件、树视图选项、编译！。在 任务 标签页中会让位给地图。 时间轴 位于地图下方:播放场景并显示每个命令的时间。参见 。 状态栏 消息、错误与提示计数(单击查看列表)、撤销历史,以及脚本最近一次编译的时间。"},{"p":"fenster.html","a":"teilen","t":"窗口","s":"并排显示两个脚本","x":"文件 → 分屏 在事件模式下最多并排显示四个脚本——用于比较和跨脚本复制命令。把命令从一个窗格拖到另一个即可复制;单击某个窗格即可在其中编辑。"},{"p":"fenster.html","a":"groesse","t":"窗口","s":"大小、外观与布局","x":"Ctrl + 鼠标滚轮缩放整个界面(50% - 300%);视图 → 界面缩放 效果相同。 视图 → 主题:BehavEd 经典、Windows、深色、午夜、浅色、高对比度。 拖动列之间的边界调整宽度;每种模式会记住自己的宽度。调试 → 恢复默认布局 恢复默认。 BehavEd-Remake 运行时在资源管理器中打开文件,会交给已打开的窗口,而不是启动第二个程序。"},{"p":"skripte.html","a":"","t":"编写脚本","s":"编写脚本","x":"事件模式:左侧是命令,中间是脚本树,右侧是操作按钮。"},{"p":"skripte.html","a":"grundlagen","t":"编写脚本","s":"脚本的结构","x":"命令从上到下执行。affect ( \"名称\", FLUSH ) { ... } 把其中的命令发送给某个角色或实体——过场动画就是这样驱动演员的。task 声明一组命令,do 并行启动它,dowait 等待其完成,wait 暂停。if、else、loop 与其他语言相同。只有 affect、task、if、else 和 loop 可以包含命令。"},{"p":"skripte.html","a":"einfuegen","t":"编写脚本","s":"添加命令","x":"在左侧的 事件 列表中双击命令,即可插入到所选行之后(或所选块中)。 或者把它拖进树中:松开的位置决定它落在某行之前、之内还是之后。 列表末尾的宏一次插入多条命令;折叠宏 将其显示为一行。 右键单击某行可在子菜单中使用相同的列表,另有编辑、复制和 查找相似。"},{"p":"skripte.html","a":"editor","t":"编写脚本","s":"事件编辑器","x":"双击某行(或按 Enter)打开 事件编辑器。顶部是命令的帮助文本,下方每个值都有自己的字段:固定选项的列表、数字和文本字段,文件字段带有 (浏览)和 播放(播放声音或打开脚本)。加载地图后,名称字段旁的箭头可以从地图中选取名称。 摄像机命令的事件编辑器。 表达式！ 把字段改为自由表达式;助手 用 Get、Tag 和 Rnd 构建 get ( ... )、tag ( ... ) 或 random ( ... );还原 恢复。 不在列表中的值也允许——模组会带来自己的值——但会被标记为未知,因为更常见的情况是拼写错误。 确定(Enter)写入数值,取消(Esc)放弃,重新求值 把字段重置为默认值。"},{"p":"skripte.html","a":"bearbeiten","t":"编写脚本","s":"选择、移动、复制","x":"单击选择一行,Ctrl+单击追加,Shift+单击选择范围。所有操作都作用于全部选中项。 拖动行即可移动。块会连同其内容一起移动;块不能放进自身。 复制、剪切、粘贴——粘贴到块中时命令只插入一次,即使块和其中的行是一起复制的。 克隆 在正下方插入副本,注释掉 把行变为注释或恢复,删除 删除。 撤销和重做记录每一步。右键单击任一按钮可查看完整历史——甚至可以只撤销其中一步而保留之后的所有操作。"},{"p":"skripte.html","a":"suchen","t":"编写脚本","s":"查找、替换、书签","x":"查找(Ctrl+F)打开一个常驻窗口:按命令名(名称为)或按值(包含)搜索,用 F3 / Shift+F3 跳转,可在当前脚本或所有已打开的脚本中替换。书签与 Notepad++ 相同:Ctrl+F2 设置,F2 跳到下一个。书签按文件保存。"},{"p":"skripte.html","a":"rand","t":"编写脚本","s":"修改标记栏","x":"启用 视图 → 更改历史（边栏） 后,彩色标记栏会标出你修改过的内容:橙色 = 已修改未保存;绿色 = 已修改已保存;蓝色 = 已恢复原样。悬停可查看原始行,右键单击某行 → 恢复为原始,只恢复这一条命令。"},{"p":"skriptfluss.html","a":"","t":"脚本流程:经典、图表、轨道","s":"脚本流程:经典、图表、轨道","x":"脚本流程 栏顶部的 经典 / 图表 / 轨道 按钮用于切换视图。分屏时每个窗格各有自己的视图。"},{"p":"skriptfluss.html","a":"classic","t":"脚本流程:经典、图表、轨道","s":"经典","x":"原版 BehavEd 的树状视图——每条命令一行,块可以展开。编辑在这里进行;参见 。"},{"p":"skriptfluss.html","a":"graph","t":"脚本流程:经典、图表、轨道","s":"图表:谁启动谁","x":"任务的关系图:玩家出生点、触发器、脚本启动器、角色和脚本及其连接。 任务由其实体串联起来:trigger 指向 target_scriptrunner,后者运行脚本,脚本控制角色并启动其他脚本。关系图正是把这些画出来。双击节点打开其脚本或在地图中显示该实体;从节点右侧的圆点拖到另一个节点即可连接——对于角色,还要选择脚本类型(spawnscript、deathscript……)。可以把列表中的实体或命令拖进图中;把命令放在空白处会新建一个脚本。 适应 显示全部,排列 整理节点,直角连线 让连线以直角穿过空隙。双击连线添加拐点,右键删除。"},{"p":"skriptfluss.html","a":"spuren","t":"脚本流程:经典、图表、轨道","s":"轨道:随时间展开的脚本","x":"轨道:摄像机镜头、角色、对白和脚本以时间块显示。 脚本栏中的紧凑时间轴:包含 摄像机、每个角色、对白(语音台词)和 脚本 等行。单击块选中其对应行,拖动右边缘修改时长,在标尺上拖动可浏览时间。地图下方的大  提供更详细的同类功能。"},{"p":"speichern.html","a":"","t":"保存、编译与检查","s":"保存、编译与检查","x":""},{"p":"speichern.html","a":"speichern","t":"保存、编译与检查","s":"保存","x":"保存(Ctrl+S)始终写入 .txt 源文件——即使你打开的是 .ibi(会保存在它旁边)。 全部保存(Ctrl+Shift+S)保存所有有修改的标签页;来自压缩包的标签页没有可写回的文件,会被跳过。 每次保存和编译都会保留一份副本——backup1.txt(最新)到 backup10.txt——位于 behaved.exe 旁的 backup 文件夹中,每个脚本一个子文件夹;文件 → 打开备份文件夹 可查看。备份 / 还原 用于手动保留和恢复一份额外副本(脚本旁的 .bak)。 自建的 ROFF 路径会随脚本一起写成 .rof 文件——参见 。"},{"p":"speichern.html","a":"uebersetzen","t":"保存、编译与检查","s":"编译","x":"操作栏中的 编译！ 会在 .txt 旁写入 .ibi(并保存 .txt)。按钮闪绿色显示 已编译,或闪红色显示 失败——此时第一处出错的行会被选中,状态栏说明原因。编译器内置,并已与 Raven IBIZE 生成的 1011 个 .ibi 文件逐字节核对。"},{"p":"speichern.html","a":"pruefen","t":"保存、编译与检查","s":"提示与错误","x":"编写时程序会检查每一行:未知命令、不在列表中的值、缺少引号的文本字段、拼错的字段(“你是否想输入……?”)。状态栏中的计数显示数量——单击查看列表,单击某条消息跳到对应行。视图 → 目标游戏 会额外提示哪些内容在多人服务器上无效。"},{"p":"karte.html","a":"","t":"地图","s":"地图","x":"地图视图:顶部为工具栏,左侧为放置图块。"},{"p":"karte.html","a":"laden","t":"地图","s":"打开地图","x":"在模式栏切换到 任务。任务会自带地图()。没有任务时,地图和文件 可从磁盘或 .pk3 打开地图,或加载单独的 .ent 文件。Scripts (N) 列出地图实体所引用的脚本——选择一个即可加载其过场动画。"},{"p":"karte.html","a":"bewegen","t":"地图","s":"视角操作","x":"飞行;Q / E 下降和上升,Shift 加速 W A S D(鼠标位于视图上) 环顾四周 按住右键拖动 平移 按住中键拖动 环绕 Alt + 鼠标中键 缩放 滚轮 飞到该处 在列表中双击实体 保存视角;1 ... 9 跳回(按地图保存) Ctrl + 1 ... 9"},{"p":"karte.html","a":"anzeige","t":"地图","s":"显示内容","x":"工具栏右侧的按钮用于开关画面中的各部分:实体、名称、脚本角色、特效、辉光、动态光、雾和天空。俯视图 像地图一样垂直向下看,并剖去剖切高度以上的一切——拖动高度框可查看其他楼层。视图设置(齿轮)包含亮度、环境光、细节、角色阴影以及 突出显示此脚本的实体,后者会淡化当前脚本未使用的所有实体。 视图设置。 画面力求与游戏一致:着色器、光照贴图、辉光(如 r_DynamicGlow)、雾(r_drawfog)、动态光、镜头光晕、天气和光剑轨迹。画面异常时,统计 会显示帧率、纹理和显卡参数。"},{"p":"entities.html","a":"","t":"实体","s":"实体","x":"选中的飞船:左侧是列表,其下是检查器,视图中是操纵器。"},{"p":"entities.html","a":"liste","t":"实体","s":"实体列表","x":"左栏把实体分组——摄像机标记、行走目标、注视目标、角色、脚本启动器、特效、声音、可移动物体、可破坏物体、NPC 路径点。眼睛图标可在视图中隐藏某组(Alt+单击:只显示该组),搜索框按名称或类别筛选。单击选择,双击飞过去,右键为其插入命令:行走目标、注视目标、affect 块、摄像机移到此标记。"},{"p":"entities.html","a":"waehlen","t":"实体","s":"在视图中选择","x":"单击标记、角色或模型即可选择;Ctrl/Shift+单击追加;在空白处拖出框可选择框内所有对象。悬停时显示边框和名称。地图下方的控制栏会显示所选实体在脚本中被使用的次数,并提供跳转到这些行的按钮。"},{"p":"entities.html","a":"gizmo","t":"实体","s":"移动与旋转","x":"视图角落的小工具栏在 移动 和 旋转 之间切换操纵器。移动模式下,可在地面上拖动实体或沿彩色箭头拖动;工具栏中设置的网格会吸附,拖动时按 Ctrl 可暂时关闭——未设置网格时,Ctrl 让箭头拖动吸附到 8 单位。旋转模式下显示圆环(Ctrl:15 度一步):蓝色左右旋转;飞船和模型还有绿色(俯仰)和红色(翻滚);角色只有蓝色圆环,因为游戏对角色只认 angle。Alt+拖动会先复制。多个选中的实体作为整体移动和旋转。 移动:只有箭头。 旋转:飞船上的三个圆环。 当时间轴位于某段运动中间时,操纵器不会修改起点,而是在该时刻设置新的路径点。参见  和 。"},{"p":"entities.html","a":"inspektor","t":"实体","s":"检查器","x":"列表下方的检查器显示所选实体:来自游戏代码的类别说明、名称、位置、地面(脚离地面的高度——陷入地面时显示红色)和 朝向 (度),生成标志以复选框显示,其余所有键以字段显示。脚本字段带有 打开,NPC_type 可搜索游戏中的所有 NPC。图标栏可以飞过去、放到地面、复制、删除、制作动画()以及显示 全部键 (原始)。鼠标位于地图或列表上时,实体的修改有独立的撤销记录。"},{"p":"entities.html","a":"setzen","t":"实体","s":"放置新实体","x":"视图左边缘的图块用于放置常见类型:角色、行走目标、摄像机/注视标记、注视目标、脚本启动器、特效、声音、NPC 路径点、玩家出生点。单击图块,再在视图中单击——或把图块拖进视图;按住 Shift 可连续放置。列表上方的 + 实体 和视图中的右键菜单(在此新建实体)提供所有类别。网格按钮可吸附到 8、16、32 或 64 单位。"},{"p":"kamera.html","a":"","t":"摄像机","s":"摄像机","x":"选中的摄像机:地图上的路径、操纵器、顶部工具栏以及左侧的镜头列表。"},{"p":"kamera.html","a":"einstellungen","t":"摄像机","s":"镜头","x":"在 ICARUS 中,一个镜头就是 camera ( MOVE, ,  ) 后接 camera ( PAN, ,  )。BehavEd-Remake 按顺序读取它们,并在地图上把每个镜头画成摄像机图标。单击图标选择摄像机;左侧的 镜头 列表显示每个镜头的时间和移动时间(移动 6.0 秒)。单击某行即可跳转。 上一个镜头 / 下一个镜头 在镜头间切换;飞到镜头 把你的视角精确移到所选镜头的位置和朝向。 在此新建镜头 在当前视角、所选镜头之后添加 MOVE 和 PAN。设为当前视角 把所选镜头移到你当前注视的位置。 删除镜头 删除镜头。在 所选镜头 下可输入精确数值:位置、方向 和 移动时间(0 = 硬切)。"},{"p":"kamera.html","a":"gizmo","t":"摄像机","s":"移动和旋转镜头","x":"视图上方的工具栏用于切换操纵器:移动 显示三个箭头和中间的方块——拖动箭头沿某一轴移动,拖动方块在视平面内移动。旋转 显示俯仰、偏航和翻滚三个圆环。世界 / 本地 决定箭头跟随地图还是摄像机。松开鼠标时新数值写入脚本——可一步撤销。 移动:箭头和中间的方块。 旋转:三个圆环。 如果抓取操纵器时时间轴位于两个关键帧之间,会在该时刻新建关键帧,而不是修改起点——就像动画软件的自动关键帧。驾驶时按 Enter 也会设置这样的关键帧()。"},{"p":"kamera.html","a":"bahnen","t":"摄像机","s":"摄像机路径","x":"选中的摄像机会绘制其路径:已飞过的部分为黄色,其余为灰色。镜头很多时会显得杂乱——当前路径 只显示进入当前镜头和通往下一个镜头的移动,全部路径 显示所有移动。两个按钮都在摄像机面板中。"},{"p":"kamera.html","a":"steuern","t":"摄像机","s":"亲自驾驶镜头","x":"驾驶 让你进入镜头:按住鼠标右键环顾四周,W A S D 移动,Q E 下降和上升。应用 把视角写入脚本,Esc 取消。驾驶时移动时间轴并按 Enter(设置关键帧),即可沿途逐个设置关键帧。"},{"p":"kamera.html","a":"vorschau","t":"摄像机","s":"预览与透过镜头观看","x":"摄像机预览(位于所选摄像机的工具栏中,视图左上角)在视图右下角显示摄像机看到的小画面;拖动时会跟随操纵器。单击画面即可全屏透过摄像机观看;此时播放时间轴,就能看到与游戏中一致的过场动画。同一工具栏中的 通过摄像机 可直接切换到摄像机视角。 播放时间轴时透过摄像机观看。 有些镜头位于某个 ref_tag 上或注视某个 ref_tag。此时面板会提示,移动镜头就会移动地图中的该 ref_tag——脚本只引用它的名字。"},{"p":"zeitleiste.html","a":"","t":"时间轴","s":"时间轴","x":"时间轴:上方是摄像机行,每个角色一行,按类型分为子行,橙色为播放头。"},{"p":"zeitleiste.html","a":"abspielen","t":"时间轴","s":"播放","x":"地图下方的播放按钮(▶)用于开始和停止播放。在标尺上单击或拖动可设置时间。速度框可放慢场景(声音仅在 1x 时播放),循环 循环播放。在标尺上滚动滚轮可缩放,在轨道上按 Ctrl+滚轮也可缩放;全部 显示全部,鼠标中键拖动视图。单位按钮可在帧与秒之间切换。"},{"p":"zeitleiste.html","a":"zeilen","t":"时间轴","s":"行与类别","x":"摄像机 行包含摄像机命令(移动、平移、缩放、淡入淡出)。下方,脚本涉及的每个角色或移动物体各占一行。单击名称旁的箭头展开:命令按 移动、动画、注视、声音、状态 和 流程(等待、信号) 分类。开始后没有任何事件的行会被隐藏;勾选 空闲轨道 即可显示。 wait 命令默认隐藏——它们仍然决定一切的时间位置,移动块时会自动调整它们。等待 将它们显示为独立的块。"},{"p":"zeitleiste.html","a":"ziehen","t":"时间轴","s":"拖动以修改时间","x":"向左或向右拖动块会改变它前面的 wait——命令提前或推迟发生,其后的一切随之移动。拖动摄像机块的末端可改变其时长。行走和飞行显示为角色行底部的条带;同样可以在时间上拖动,右键单击行走条带可在步行和奔跑之间切换。 单击块会在脚本中选中对应行,地图也会跳到该时刻——时间轴、脚本和地图始终显示同一内容。 时间来自对游戏 ICARUS 引擎的重现,包括其特性:wait 比写入值晚一个游戏帧(50 毫秒)结束,dowait 会等待它指定的任务。无法确定时间时(例如 waitsignal),时间轴会明确提示,而不是猜测。"},{"p":"figuren.html","a":"","t":"角色与路径","s":"角色与路径","x":"行走中的角色:前方路径为灰色,已走过的部分为黄色,起点和终点有控制柄。"},{"p":"figuren.html","a":"folgen","t":"角色与路径","s":"选择角色和飞船","x":"在视图中单击角色或飞船即可选中其实体——角色的生成器、飞船的笔刷实体。模型移动时标记和操纵器会跟随,轮廓线显示选中的对象。角色身上的箭头指示模型的朝向。"},{"p":"figuren.html","a":"griffe","t":"角色与路径","s":"起点、终点与新路径点","x":"拖动终点控制柄可移动行走目标(waypoint_navgoal)或飞行终点。 拖动起点控制柄只移动起点,而不是整条线。 在行走途中抓取角色(时间轴位于出发与到达之间)并拖动:会在该时刻创建新的路径点——角色为新的导航点,飞船为拆分后的 move。 旋转同理:在飞行途中,圆环会以新角度创建新的路径点;对于角色,会在该时刻写入 set ( SET_ANGLES )——行走中则在到达时生效,因为游戏会让行走的角色面向行进方向。"},{"p":"figuren.html","a":"gangart","t":"角色与路径","s":"步行或奔跑、共享目标","x":"右键单击行走路径的终点控制柄(或时间轴中的条带)打开菜单: 行走(从此段起) / 奔跑(从此段起)——在导航点前写入 SET_WALKING 或 SET_RUNNING。 行走时注视——角色行走时持续转向另一个角色(SET_WATCHTARGET)。 倒退行走(保持向后看)——在起点后方放置注视标记使其倒退行走;面向行走方向 取消。 多个角色共用一个导航点时,移动它会影响所有角色。BehavEd-Remake 会察觉这一点,先为这段行走复制一个独立目标——状态栏会告诉你新建了哪个。 已有脚本中的倒退行走也会被识别:角色朝与面向相反的方向移动时,场景会像游戏一样播放 BOTH_WALKBACK1 或 BOTH_RUNBACK1。"},{"p":"animation.html","a":"","t":"移动物体动画与 ROFF 文件","s":"移动物体动画与 ROFF 文件","x":"ROFF 模式下的 动画 窗口以及地图上飞船的路径。"},{"p":"animation.html","a":"start","t":"移动物体动画与 ROFF 文件","s":"打开窗口","x":"选择一个可移动实体——例如 func_static 飞船、func_door 等 func_* 笔刷实体,以及 misc_model_breakable、fx_runner——然后在检查器中按 动画。如果它还没有 script_targetname,会自动获得一个,因为脚本只能移动有名字的对象。"},{"p":"animation.html","a":"schluessel","t":"移动物体动画与 ROFF 文件","s":"关键帧","x":"把时间轴移到运动开始处,按 在播放头添加关键帧——第一个关键帧记录实体当前的位置。 在时间上前进后再按一次。然后在视图中拖动新的菱形(Shift:仅上下),或在表格中输入数值:时间、位置、方向。 或者直接使用操纵器:只要窗口显示该实体且时间轴位于第一个关键帧或其后,用操纵器移动或旋转就会在播放头处设置关键帧(或修改已有的关键帧)。 删除关键帧 和 转到关键帧 作用于所选行;移除动画 从脚本中移除整个动画。"},{"p":"animation.html","a":"arten","t":"移动物体动画与 ROFF 文件","s":"脚本(move)还是 ROFF 文件","x":"保存为 脚本开头带 move 和 wait 的 affect 块 scripts/.rof,由 play ( \"PLAY_ROFF\", ... ) 播放 关键帧之间 每段移动开始快、结尾减速,与游戏的移动物体相同(或用 线性 匀速) 穿过所有关键帧的平滑曲线(平滑)或直线段 适合 门、升降机、穿过画面的飞船 多转弯的长距离自由飞行、精确到帧的特效 用窗口顶部的 脚本 (move) / ROFF 文件 切换——关键帧会被转换,不会丢失。ROFF 模式下 文件 字段指定文件名(例如 md_am/roffs/sta2);下方显示其帧数和秒数。"},{"p":"animation.html","a":"roff","t":"移动物体动画与 ROFF 文件","s":"ROFF 文件的原理","x":"ROFF 文件(.rof,“Rotation and Origin File Format”)为每个游戏帧保存一小步:实体在接下来 50 毫秒内移动和旋转多少。游戏在 PLAY_ROFF 执行时,把这些步长累加到实体当时所在的位置——因此 ROFF 路径是相对的:移动实体,整条路径也随之移动。游戏和 Movie Duels 中的全部 108 个文件都是版本 2,除一个外均为每帧 50 毫秒——BehavEd-Remake 也按此格式写入。 你编辑的关键帧作为注释行保存在脚本中 play 的正前方;.rof 由它们生成。因此撤销、复制和粘贴对 ROFF 路径与普通命令一样有效。保存脚本时,文件写入同一 scripts 文件夹下的 scripts/.rof;保存任务 会把它打包进任务的 .pk3。"},{"p":"animation.html","a":"bearbeiten","t":"移动物体动画与 ROFF 文件","s":"编辑游戏中的 ROFF 文件","x":"当脚本在该实体上播放现成的 ROFF 时,窗口会在 此实体在脚本中的 ROFF 路径: 下列出。编辑 把它分解为关键帧——直线段或一条平滑曲线,取所需关键帧较少的一种——与原文件误差在半个单位以内。游戏文件永远不会被覆盖:你编辑的是副本(…_2),play 命令会指向该副本。 飞船沿 ROFF 路径飞行。 在时间轴中,ROFF 飞行显示为 移动 下的条带;拖动可让飞行提前或推迟开始。"},{"p":"wegpunkte.html","a":"","t":"NPC 路径点","s":"NPC 路径点","x":"NPC 路径点 窗口及地图上的路网。 通过地图工具栏中的 NPC 路径点 打开。显示路网 绘制路径:绿色为手动设置(target),蓝色为自动(导航点和战斗点),橙色为跳跃(targetJump)。 放置路径点:单击地面——每个新点都会与上一个相连。Shift+单击开始新路径,Esc 结束。 连接:单击两个点将其连接(Ctrl:跳跃连接);单击两个已连接的点会断开。每个点最多四个连接。 生成路网 在可行走的地面上分布路径点(间距:原版关卡约 230)并连接——可一步撤销。移除已生成 只删除这些点,手动放置的保留。 检查路网 找出游戏会拒绝或 NPC 无法使用的部分;单击某个问题即可飞过去。"},{"p":"missionen.html","a":"","t":"任务","s":"任务","x":""},{"p":"missionen.html","a":"laden","t":"任务","s":"打开任务","x":"加载任务…(文件 菜单或地图工具栏)选择一个 .pk3 并列出其中的任务——带脚本的地图。选择一个,一切就绪:地图、包含任务角色的 .ent,以及任务的每个脚本各占一个标签页;第一个脚本(通常是开场)显示在最前。所有标签页共享地图和摄像机。 压缩包中的任务——使用同一张地图的任务归为一组。"},{"p":"missionen.html","a":"zuletzt","t":"任务","s":"最近的任务","x":"文件 → 最近的任务 和起始页面列出最近打开的任务——无论来自压缩包还是任务文件夹。单击即可重新打开整个项目:地图、实体和所有脚本。文件已不存在的条目会从列表中移除。 文件 → 最近的任务。"},{"p":"missionen.html","a":"neu","t":"任务","s":"新建任务","x":"新建任务 可在任意地图上开始一个任务。选择地图,为任务命名(字母、数字和 _;游戏以 maps/.bsp 加载,即 devmap ),并指定脚本文件夹。BehavEd-Remake 会创建玩家出生点、脚本启动器、开场脚本,以及位于 文档\\behaved\\missions 下的任务文件夹。玩家出生时开场脚本开始运行。 新建任务 对话框。 从未打包的任务保存在其文件夹中;重启后可用 打开任务文件夹 继续。"},{"p":"missionen.html","a":"speichern","t":"任务","s":"保存任务","x":"保存任务 会显示将放入压缩包的内容——每个文件及其大小——并先检查任务:实体使用了但不存在的脚本、无法编译的脚本、缺少玩家出生点、指向不存在目标的引用、缺少 ENDMARKER 的 .str。错误(红色)必须修正,警告(橙色)可以保留。保存 保存所有脚本、写入 .ent、编译脚本、加入你自己的 ROFF 文件,并把 .pk3 打包到游戏文件夹。 带检查结果的 保存任务 对话框。 压缩包会写到其他模组压缩包旁边(Movie Duels 文件夹中的 zz_.pk3,以便优先于旧文件)。启动游戏并在控制台输入 devmap  即可游玩。"},{"p":"modell.html","a":"","t":"模型视图与角色","s":"模型视图与角色","x":"模型模式:左侧是动画列表,中间是模型,下方是播放栏。 在模式栏切换到 模型。NPC 列出游戏中的所有角色(来自 .npc 文件)——单击即可按游戏中的样子加载其模型和皮肤。打开 .glm… 和 从 .pk3… 可打开任意模型。鼠标左键环绕,中键平移,滚轮缩放;转台、骨骼 和 适应视图 位于工具栏中。 左侧的 动画 列表显示骨骼的每个动画及其长度;可按名称或 BOTH / TORSO / LEGS / FACE 筛选。单击播放;双击(或 插入脚本)会在当前脚本所选行之后写入 set ( SET_ANIM_BOTH, \"…\" )——TORSO 动画使用 SET_ANIM_UPPER,LEGS 动画使用 SET_ANIM_LOWER。"},{"p":"tutorials.html","a":"","t":"教程","s":"教程","x":""},{"p":"tutorials.html","a":"projekt","t":"教程","s":"The big one: your own mission","x":"All tutorials use the base game - the map taspir1 and its characters - so the pictures match what you see. Any other map, and any mod such as Movie Duels, works the same way. If the parts of the window are new to you, read  and  first."},{"p":"tutorials.html","a":"kurz","t":"教程","s":"Short tutorials","x":"Each one shows one small thing in three to six steps - start with any of them. Scripts Camera and timeline Figures Map and entities Animation Missions and models"},{"p":"tut-projekt.html","a":"","t":"Your own mission: take-off on Taspir","s":"Your own mission: take-off on Taspir","x":"The finished cutscene, seen through its camera. This tutorial uses only the base game: the map taspir1 - the landing pad at the start of the Taspir III mission - with Kyle's ship, the Raven's Claw, and the characters Kyle and Rosh. You need nothing but Jedi Academy and BehavEd. Every picture on the following pages was taken while exactly this mission was built, step by step."},{"p":"tut-projekt.html","a":"teile","t":"Your own mission: take-off on Taspir","s":"The parts","x":""},{"p":"tut-projekt.html","a":"vorher","t":"Your own mission: take-off on Taspir","s":"Before you start","x":"Add the game folder once: 编辑 → 游戏目录 → 添加游戏目录… → the base folder of Jedi Academy (the one with assets0.pk3). See . If the window is new to you, read  first - five minutes. Everything can be undone with Ctrl+Z. The game files are never changed: your mission goes into its own folder and its own .pk3."},{"p":"tut-p1.html","a":"","t":"1 · Create the mission","s":"1 · Create the mission","x":""},{"p":"tut-p1.html","a":"schritte","t":"1 · Create the mission","s":"步骤","x":"Open the start page. Switch the mode bar to 任务. Without a map, the tab shows the start page. New mission. Click 创建新任务. In the list type taspir1 and pick it. As 任务名称 type taspir_tut - letters, digits and _. The 脚本文件夹 is filled in by itself. Press 创建. Look at what you got. The map opens on the landing pad. behaved has added a target_scriptrunner next to the player start: when the player spawns, the script taspir_tut/intro runs. It is open in a tab - a short camera shot behind the player start. Switch off the original intro. taspir1 has its own start: its player start already triggers a runner with taspir1/preIntro, and the same trigger now starts yours too - both would play at once. Type t271 into the search box of the entity list - that is the runner of the original (its usescript is taspir1/preIntro) - select it and press Delete. The 图表 view shows such connections at a glance (). Every map of the game works this way. Its own entities stay; remove what you do not want - it changes only your mission, never the game."},{"p":"tut-p2.html","a":"","t":"2 · Place the characters","s":"2 · Place the characters","x":""},{"p":"tut-p2.html","a":"schritte","t":"2 · Place the characters","s":"步骤","x":"Look at the pad. Hold the right mouse button and fly with W A S D until you see the pad from the south, a little from above. Place Kyle. Click the tile 角色 (NPC_spawner) on the left edge of the view, then click near the south edge of the pad. A character marker appears and is selected. Name him. In the inspector under the entity list set 名称 to kyle and NPC_type to Kyle (the ... button lists every character of the game). 放到地面 puts him exactly on the ground. Place Rosh the same way beside him: 名称 rosh, NPC_type rosh_penin. Two walk targets. Click the tile 行走目标 (waypoint_navgoal) and click in front of the ship - name it nav_kyle. A second one beside it: nav_rosh. Hold Shift while clicking to place several entities of one kind. More in ."},{"p":"tut-p3.html","a":"","t":"3 · Let them walk","s":"3 · Let them walk","x":""},{"p":"tut-p3.html","a":"schritte","t":"3 · Let them walk","s":"步骤","x":"Write the walk for Kyle. In the intro script, after the camera lines, insert affect (double-click it in the 事件 list) and give it the name kyle. Inside it insert task named walk, and inside the task set ( SET_WALKING, true ) and set ( SET_NAVGOAL, nav_kyle ). After the task: dowait ( walk ) and set ( SET_LOOK_TARGET, rosh ). The same for Rosh - copy the block (复制, 粘贴) and change the names: rosh, nav_rosh, look target kyle. Watch them walk. Drag the playhead in the timeline. Both walk at the same time - an affect block does not hold up the script. Click Kyle to see his path: grey ahead, yellow behind. Walk or run. Right-click the walk target at the end of his path: 行走(从此段起), 奔跑(从此段起), 倒退行走(保持向后看) or 行走时注视 change how he gets there. A detour. Grab Kyle in the middle of his walk and drag him aside: behaved inserts a new walk target there, and his path bends around it. Why the task? SET_NAVGOAL only starts the walk. dowait waits until the task is done - until he has arrived - so he looks at Rosh only when he stands. More in ."},{"p":"tut-p4.html","a":"","t":"4 · The camera","s":"4 · The camera","x":""},{"p":"tut-p4.html","a":"schritte","t":"4 · The camera","s":"步骤","x":"The first shot is already there - the template behind the player start. Select it in the 镜头 list, fly out to a wide view of the pad from the south-east and press 设为当前视角: the shot is now where you are looking. A second shot. Fly down behind Kyle and Rosh, low, looking at the ship. Press 在此新建镜头 and set its 移动时间 to 4 seconds: the camera flies from the wide shot to this one while the two walk. Fine-tune in the view. The camera bar has 移动 (arrows) and 旋转 (rings). Releasing writes the change into the script. Or fly it. 驾驶 puts you into the shot: right mouse looks, W A S D move. Enter sets a key at the playhead, 应用 keeps it, Esc throws it away. Look through it. 摄像机预览 shows a small picture of what the camera sees; click it to look through the camera."},{"p":"tut-p5.html","a":"","t":"5 · The ship takes off","s":"5 · The ship takes off","x":""},{"p":"tut-p5.html","a":"schritte","t":"5 · The ship takes off","s":"步骤","x":"Select the ship. The Raven's Claw on the pad is a misc_model_breakable named ravensClaw. Click it on the map, then 动画 in the inspector. ROFF file. In the 动画 window choose ROFF 文件. The script gets a block that plays the file, and the first key is where the ship stands now. Set the keys. At 5 s press 在播放头添加关键帧 - the ship still stands. At 6.5 s drag it straight up a little: a key is set at the playhead. At 8.5 s drag it forward and higher, and tip the nose up with the ring. At 10.5 s it is far away and high. Watch. Play the timeline: the ship lifts off and flies away. 平滑 makes one curve through the keys. Saved with the script. Saving writes scripts/taspir_tut/roffs/ravensClaw.rof next to the script; 保存任务 packs it into the .pk3. Animating with move commands instead of a file: . Changing a ROFF of the game: ."},{"p":"tut-p6.html","a":"","t":"6 · Cut, shake, follow, fade","s":"6 · Cut, shake, follow, fade","x":""},{"p":"tut-p6.html","a":"schritte","t":"6 · Cut, shake, follow, fade","s":"步骤","x":"Cut. After the second camera move insert a wait of 5 seconds, then a new shot from outside the pad, looking at the ship, with 移动时间 0 - a cut. Shake. Insert camera and choose SHAKE: strength 4, 2000 milliseconds - the engines start. Follow the ship. Two camera ( PAN ) commands with a duration turn the camera up after the ship while it climbs; a wait after each lets them finish. Fade out. camera with FADE: from 0 0 0 and 0 to 0 0 0 and 1 in 1500 ms - black. Then camera ( DISABLE ) gives control back to the player. Fix the timing. Play and watch. Drag blocks in the timeline: everything after moves along. Drag a right edge to change a duration. The whole scene. Turn on 通过摄像机 and play from the start."},{"p":"tut-p7.html","a":"","t":"7 · A second script","s":"7 · A second script","x":""},{"p":"tut-p7.html","a":"schritte","t":"7 · A second script","s":"步骤","x":"A spawnscript key. Select Kyle, add the key spawnscript with the value taspir_tut/kyle_spawn (+ 键 in the inspector). Open creates it. Press 打开 next to the key: the script does not exist yet, so behaved creates it in the mission folder and opens it in a tab. A macro. Double-click standOnly at the end of the 事件 list: three set commands that make Kyle stand and ignore enemies. Add set ( SET_WEAPON, WP_SABER ). Side by side. 文件 → 分屏 → 2 shows the intro beside the spawn script. Drag lines from one to the other to copy them."},{"p":"tut-p8.html","a":"","t":"8 · Save and play","s":"8 · Save and play","x":""},{"p":"tut-p8.html","a":"schritte","t":"8 · Save and play","s":"步骤","x":"Save mission. Press 保存任务 in the map toolbar. The window lists every file it will pack and checks the mission: errors in red must be fixed, warnings in orange may stay. Pack. Press 保存: scripts are saved and compiled, the .ent with your entities and the ROFF are written, and zz_taspir_tut.pk3 goes into the game folder. Play. Start Jedi Academy, open the console (Shift+~) and type devmap taspir_tut. The cutscene runs as soon as you spawn. Next time. 文件 → 最近的任务 opens the whole mission again - map, entities and both scripts. Share the .pk3 with others: it holds everything the mission needs. Players put it into their base folder."},{"p":"k-neues-skript.html","a":"","t":"Write a script from scratch","s":"Write a script from scratch","x":""},{"p":"k-neues-skript.html","a":"schritte","t":"Write a script from scratch","s":"步骤","x":"Start an empty script. Click the + at the end of the tab bar (or 文件 → 新建). A tab unnamed.txt opens; switch the mode bar to 事件. Insert an affect block. In the 事件 list on the left, double-click affect. It appears in the tree, already open, because a block holds commands. Name the figure. Double-click the new line (or press Enter) to open the 事件编辑器. Type the name of the figure into the first field - with a map loaded, the arrow next to it lists every name of the map. Leave FLUSH and press 确定. Put a command inside. Click the affect line once, then double-click wait in the list: because the selected block is open, the command goes to the start of the block. Commands inserted after that follow it, in order. Save. 保存 (Ctrl+S) asks for a name the first time. Script names are lower case without spaces, for example my_first.txt."},{"p":"k-neues-skript.html","a":"tipps","t":"Write a script from scratch","s":"须知","x":"With a closed block selected, a new command goes after the block, not into it. Only affect, task, if, else and loop can hold commands."},{"p":"k-befehl-einfuegen.html","a":"","t":"Three ways to add a command","s":"Three ways to add a command","x":""},{"p":"k-befehl-einfuegen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Three ways to add a command","s":"步骤","x":"Double-click. Select the line after which the command should come, then double-click the command in the 事件 list. That is how the original BehavEd worked. Insert key. Click a command in the list once (it stays highlighted), select a line in the tree and press Insert. Handy when you add the same command several times. Drag. Drag the command from the list into the tree. While you drag, a line shows where it lands: above a line, below it, or - on the middle of a block - inside the block. Right-click. Right-click a line: the submenus 事件 and Macros insert after that line - or into the block, if you right-clicked an open block."},{"p":"k-befehl-einfuegen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Three ways to add a command","s":"须知","x":"Hover over a command in the list to read what it does. Macros at the end of the list add several commands at once, for example walkOnly."},{"p":"k-werte-bearbeiten.html","a":"","t":"Change the values of a command","s":"Change the values of a command","x":""},{"p":"k-werte-bearbeiten.html","a":"schritte","t":"Change the values of a command","s":"步骤","x":"Open the editor. Double-click a line or press Enter. The help text of the command is on top, each value has its own field. Pick from a list. Fields with fixed choices are lists you can also type into: start typing to filter. A value that is not in the list is allowed (mods bring their own), but it is marked unknown - check for a typo. Files and names. File fields have  to browse and 播放 to play a sound or open a script. With a map loaded, an arrow next to name fields picks a name from the map. An expression instead of a value. 表达式！ turns a field into free text. 助手 builds one for you: Get reads a variable (get), Tag the place or angles of a ref_tag (tag), Rnd a random number (random). 还原 goes back to a plain value. Done. 确定 (Enter) writes the values, 取消 (Esc) leaves everything as it was. Under each field you see the value it had before (……原为)."},{"p":"k-zeilen-ordnen.html","a":"","t":"Move, copy and comment out lines","s":"Move, copy and comment out lines","x":""},{"p":"k-zeilen-ordnen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Move, copy and comment out lines","s":"步骤","x":"Select. Click a line; Ctrl+click adds lines, Shift+click selects a range. Every action works on everything selected. Move. Drag the selection to a new place, or press Alt+Up / Alt+Down to move it one line - it stays inside its block. A block moves with everything inside it. Duplicate. 克隆 (Space) inserts a copy right below - the quickest way to a second camera shot or a second walk. Copy between scripts. 复制 (Ctrl+C), switch tabs, select a line, 粘贴 (Ctrl+V). Pasting puts the commands below the selected line. Switch off without deleting. 注释掉 (Backspace) turns the lines into comments; the game skips them. Press it again (or Ctrl+Backspace) to switch them back on."},{"p":"k-zeilen-ordnen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Move, copy and comment out lines","s":"须知","x":"删除 (Delete) removes lines for good - but Ctrl+Z brings them back."},{"p":"k-rueckgaengig.html","a":"","t":"Undo anything - even one step from the middle","s":"Undo anything - even one step from the middle","x":""},{"p":"k-rueckgaengig.html","a":"schritte","t":"Undo anything - even one step from the middle","s":"步骤","x":"Undo and redo. Ctrl+Z undoes the last change, Ctrl+Y redoes it. The Undo entry in the 编辑 menu names the step, for example *Undo: delete*. See the history. Right-click the Undo button in the action column (or 编辑 → 撤销历史). The list shows every step, newest at the top. Go back several steps. Click a step and press 撤销到此处: that step and all newer ones are undone. Undo one old step only. Click a step and press 仅撤销此步骤: only that change is undone, everything you did after it stays."},{"p":"k-rueckgaengig.html","a":"tipps","t":"Undo anything - even one step from the middle","s":"须知","x":"Entities on the map have their own undo: Ctrl+Z acts on them while the mouse is over the map or the entity list. To take back a command to the state it had when the file was opened, right-click it → 恢复为原始."},{"p":"k-suchen-ersetzen.html","a":"","t":"Find and replace in all open scripts","s":"Find and replace in all open scripts","x":""},{"p":"k-suchen-ersetzen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Find and replace in all open scripts","s":"步骤","x":"Open all scripts. For a mission, 加载任务… opens every script in its own tab. Open Find. 查找 (Ctrl+F). The window stays open while you work. Search a value. Type the old name into 包含. 查找下一个 (F3) and 查找上一个 (Shift+F3) step through the hits. Tick 仅完全匹配 so that kyle does not also hit kyle2. Search a command. 名称为 finds commands by name, for example every camera. Both fields together find only commands that match both. Replace. Type the new name into 替换为 and press 在所有打开的文档中全部替换. Each script gets one undo step."},{"p":"k-suchen-ersetzen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Find and replace in all open scripts","s":"须知","x":"Right-click a line → 查找相似 fills the Find window for you: every command of this kind, or every command with one of its values."},{"p":"k-lesezeichen.html","a":"","t":"Bookmarks and the split view","s":"Bookmarks and the split view","x":""},{"p":"k-lesezeichen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Bookmarks and the split view","s":"步骤","x":"Set a bookmark. Select a line and press Ctrl+F2 (编辑 → 书签). A mark appears next to the line. Jump. F2 goes to the next bookmark, Shift+F2 to the previous one. Bookmarks are kept per file. Split the view. Open a second script, then 文件 → 分屏 → 2. The second script shows beside the first. Copy across. The right side is read-only, but you can drag lines from it into your script - they are copied. To edit the right one, click its tab."},{"p":"k-lesezeichen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Bookmarks and the split view","s":"须知","x":"The split view works in the 事件 mode; the map and model views need the room."},{"p":"k-uebersetzen.html","a":"","t":"Compile and fix errors","s":"Compile and fix errors","x":""},{"p":"k-uebersetzen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Compile and fix errors","s":"步骤","x":"Compile. Press 编译！ at the bottom of the action column. It saves the .txt and writes the .ibi next to it. The button flashes green when it worked. When it fails. The button flashes red, the status line says *Compile failed*, and the first wrong line is selected in the tree. Read the messages. Click the red or yellow counter in the status line at the bottom: the 消息 window lists every message. Each one names the line and what is wrong. Fix and compile again. Usually it is a value in the wrong form - text without quotes, a missing }, a comparison other than =  !. Fix it in the editor and press 编译！ again."},{"p":"k-uebersetzen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Compile and fix errors","s":"须知","x":"For a mission, 保存任务 compiles every script at once and refuses to pack while one does not compile. Every save and compile keeps a copy: 文件 → 打开备份文件夹 shows the last ten."},{"p":"k-tasks.html","a":"","t":"Wait until a figure has arrived","s":"Wait until a figure has arrived","x":""},{"p":"k-tasks.html","a":"schritte","t":"Wait until a figure has arrived","s":"步骤","x":"Why. An affect block runs beside the script - the script does not wait for it, so two figures in two blocks already walk at the same time. But inside a block, set ( SET_NAVGOAL ) only *starts* the walk: the next command follows at once, and the figure would turn or talk while still walking. Put the walk into a task. Inside the figure's affect block insert task and name it, for example walk. Move the SET_NAVGOAL (and SET_WALKING, if you use it) into the task block. dowait. After the task insert dowait ( \"walk\" ). It starts the task and waits until it is done - until the figure has arrived. Everything after it happens when the figure stands. Two things at once. do ( \"walk\" ) starts a task and goes on at once. Declare a second task - for example look with a SET_LOOK_TARGET - and start both with do. Later, wait ( \"walk\" ) waits for the first one. Check it in the timeline. Play the scene: what follows a dowait starts where the walk block ends. Drag the walk target, and the rest moves with it."},{"p":"k-tasks.html","a":"tipps","t":"Wait until a figure has arrived","s":"须知","x":"Commands marked with * in their help text (such as SET_NAVGOAL) finish their task only when the action is done - that is what makes dowait wait."},{"p":"k-signale.html","a":"","t":"Let two scripts wait for each other","s":"Let two scripts wait for each other","x":""},{"p":"k-signale.html","a":"schritte","t":"Let two scripts wait for each other","s":"步骤","x":"Where to wait. In the script that should pause, insert waitsignal and type a name, for example door_open. Where to give the signal. In the other script, at the moment it should go on, insert signal ( \"door_open\" ). Check the names. Both must be spelled the same. Only one script can wait for a signal of a given name. See it in the timeline. Expand the figure's group in the timeline: the row 流程(等待、信号) shows waits and signals as blocks."},{"p":"k-signale.html","a":"tipps","t":"Let two scripts wait for each other","s":"须知","x":"The timeline cannot know how long a waitsignal waits in the game - everything after it is placed as if the signal came at once."},{"p":"k-makros.html","a":"","t":"Use macros","s":"Use macros","x":""},{"p":"k-makros.html","a":"schritte","t":"Use macros","s":"步骤","x":"Find them. The macros are at the end of the 事件 list, each with the number of commands it holds. Hover over one to read what it does. Insert. Double-click or drag a macro like a command. walkOnly, for example, makes a figure walk and ignore enemies and alerts - five set commands. Fold or unfold. 折叠宏 in the action column shows a macro as one line. Switch it off to see and change the single commands."},{"p":"k-pilot.html","a":"","t":"Fly a camera shot yourself","s":"Fly a camera shot yourself","x":""},{"p":"k-pilot.html","a":"schritte","t":"Fly a camera shot yourself","s":"步骤","x":"Select a shot. Click the camera on the map or a shot in the 镜头 list on the left. Start Pilot. Press 驾驶 on the camera bar. You now look through this shot. Fly. Hold the right mouse button to look around, W A S D move, Q / E go down and up, Shift is faster. Set keys along the way. Move the playhead in the timeline, fly to where the camera should be at that moment and press Enter (设置关键帧). Repeat for more keys. Finish. 应用 writes the view into the script; Esc (取消) leaves it as it was."},{"p":"k-kamera-ansicht.html","a":"","t":"Put a shot where you are looking","s":"Put a shot where you are looking","x":""},{"p":"k-kamera-ansicht.html","a":"schritte","t":"Put a shot where you are looking","s":"步骤","x":"Fly to the view you want. Right mouse button + W A S D. A new shot. 在此新建镜头 adds camera ( MOVE ) and camera ( PAN ) at your view, after the selected shot. Or move an existing one. Select a shot and press 设为当前视角: position and direction are replaced, one undo step. Check. 通过摄像机 on the map toolbar shows what the selected shot sees, with its zoom and the black cinema bars."},{"p":"k-kamera-ansicht.html","a":"tipps","t":"Put a shot where you are looking","s":"须知","x":"Save views you come back to: Ctrl+1 … 9 stores the view, 1 … 9 jumps back. They are kept per map."},{"p":"k-kamera-marke.html","a":"","t":"Aim the camera at a mark on the map","s":"Aim the camera at a mark on the map","x":""},{"p":"k-kamera-marke.html","a":"schritte","t":"Aim the camera at a mark on the map","s":"步骤","x":"Place a mark. Click the tile 摄像机/注视标记 (ref_tag) on the left edge of the view, then click where the camera should stand. Give it a 名称 in the inspector, such as cam_door. Camera to the mark. Right-click the mark in the entity list → 摄像机到此标记 (MOVE + PAN). Two camera commands are inserted that use the mark's place and angles. Move the mark. Drag the mark in the view or change its 位置: the shot moves with it. Turn it. The mark's facing is the camera's direction. If the mark aims at a target, move the target to change the view."},{"p":"k-zoom-blende.html","a":"","t":"Zoom, fade to black and shake","s":"Zoom, fade to black and shake","x":""},{"p":"k-zoom-blende.html","a":"schritte","t":"Zoom, fade to black and shake","s":"步骤","x":"Insert a camera command. Double-click camera in the 事件 list, then open it with Enter. The first field chooses what it does. Zoom. Choose ZOOM: the first number is the field of view (80 is normal, smaller is closer), the second the time in milliseconds to get there. Fade. Choose FADE: start colour and opacity, end colour and opacity (0 to 1), and the time. 0 0 0, 0 to 0 0 0, 1 fades to black. Shake. Choose SHAKE: strength 0 to 16 and the duration in milliseconds. The timeline shows zoom, fade and shake in their own rows under 摄像机."},{"p":"k-neu-timen.html","a":"","t":"Retime a cutscene in the timeline","s":"Retime a cutscene in the timeline","x":""},{"p":"k-neu-timen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Retime a cutscene in the timeline","s":"步骤","x":"Play it. Press ▶ under the map and watch. Switch Sound on to hear the dialogue you are matching the cuts against. Move a block. Drag a block left or right. Everything after it moves along, so the rest stays in sync. Hold Alt to move only this block. Change a duration. Drag the right edge of a block - a camera move, a wait - to make it shorter or longer. Step exactly. With the mouse over the timeline, Left / Right move the playhead by 50 ms, with Shift by one second. Check the script. Every drag changes a value in the script (a wait, a time). Click a block to see its line."},{"p":"k-neu-timen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Retime a cutscene in the timeline","s":"须知","x":"A warning sign on a camera block means it overlaps the next one - in the game the next move would start from where this one began, and the camera jumps."},{"p":"k-ansichten.html","a":"","t":"Look through the camera while you work","s":"Look through the camera while you work","x":""},{"p":"k-ansichten.html","a":"schritte","t":"Look through the camera while you work","s":"步骤","x":"Through camera. 通过摄像机 on the map toolbar shows the picture of the selected shot, with zoom and cinema bars. The small preview. 摄像机预览 on the camera bar puts a small picture of the camera's view in the bottom right corner - you keep flying freely. Click the picture to look through it. Follow. 跟随 in the timeline moves your view along with the camera while it plays. Slow motion. The speed list next to the play button plays at 0.25x to 2x. Sound plays only at 1x."},{"p":"k-gangart.html","a":"","t":"Walk, run or walk backwards","s":"Walk, run or walk backwards","x":""},{"p":"k-gangart.html","a":"schritte","t":"Walk, run or walk backwards","s":"步骤","x":"Show the path. Click the figure on the map or its name in the timeline. Its path appears: grey ahead of the playhead, yellow where it already walked. Right-click a walk target on the path. The menu offers 行走(从此段起), 奔跑(从此段起) and 倒退行走(保持向后看). Pick one. behaved writes SET_WALKING / SET_RUNNING before this walk. It counts from this walk on - later walks keep it unless you change them too. Watch. Play the timeline: the figure is faster, and the walk block in the timeline is shorter."},{"p":"k-ansehen.html","a":"","t":"Make a figure look at someone","s":"Make a figure look at someone","x":""},{"p":"k-ansehen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Make a figure look at someone","s":"步骤","x":"While walking. Right-click a walk target on the path → 行走时注视 → pick a figure. The figure walks and keeps its head on the other one. Standing. Right-click the target entity in the entity list → 转向它 (SET_WATCHTARGET) (SET_WATCHTARGET) or 作为注视目标插入 (SET_LOOK_TARGET) (SET_LOOK_TARGET). The command goes into the script after the selected line. Back to normal. Right-click the walk target → 面向行走方向. Check it. Play the timeline. The category 注视 in the figure's group shows when it looks where."},{"p":"k-blickrichtung.html","a":"","t":"Turn a figure at a moment","s":"Turn a figure at a moment","x":""},{"p":"k-blickrichtung.html","a":"schritte","t":"Turn a figure at a moment","s":"步骤","x":"Go to the moment. Move the playhead in the timeline to where the figure should face another way. Select the figure on the map and switch the gizmo bar to 旋转. Turn. Drag the ring. When you let go, behaved writes the facing at this time into the script (a SET_ANGLES), and the status line says *Facing … degrees at … s*. During a walk. Turning while the figure walks sets the facing for when it arrives."},{"p":"k-blickrichtung.html","a":"tipps","t":"Turn a figure at a moment","s":"须知","x":"If the time is not known - a waitsignal or dowait before - behaved says so instead of guessing."},{"p":"k-animation-abspielen.html","a":"","t":"Let a figure play an animation","s":"Let a figure play an animation","x":""},{"p":"k-animation-abspielen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Let a figure play an animation","s":"步骤","x":"Load the figure's model. Switch to 模型 and press NPC: click a character - its model and skin load as in the game. Find an animation. Type into 搜索动画, for example TALK. BOTH, TORSO, LEGS filter by body part. Watch it. Click an animation: it plays. 循环, the speed and the frame buttons help to look closely. Into the script. Select a line in your script first (inside the figure's affect block), then double-click the animation or press 插入脚本: set ( SET_ANIM_BOTH, \"…\" ) is inserted after that line. See it on the map. Switch back to 任务 and play the timeline: the figure plays the animation at that point."},{"p":"k-dialog.html","a":"","t":"Add a line of dialogue","s":"Add a line of dialogue","x":""},{"p":"k-dialog.html","a":"schritte","t":"Add a line of dialogue","s":"步骤","x":"Insert sound. Inside the figure's affect block, insert sound. In the editor choose the channel CHAN_VOICE and pick the file with ; 播放 plays it. Hear it in the scene. Switch 声音 on in the timeline and play: the line sounds at its moment. See it. The 轨道 view (top of the script column) has a 对白 row - every voice line as a block, so you see where the cuts fall. Time it. A wait after the sound keeps the next command until the line is over. Drag the wait's edge in the timeline to fit."},{"p":"k-entity-setzen.html","a":"","t":"Place, move and turn entities","s":"Place, move and turn entities","x":""},{"p":"k-entity-setzen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Place, move and turn entities","s":"步骤","x":"Place. Click a tile on the left edge of the view - for example 行走目标 (waypoint_navgoal) - then click on the floor. Hold Shift to place several. Esc stops. Move. Drag the entity over the floor, or drag a coloured arrow to move it along one axis. Ctrl snaps to 8 units. Turn. Switch the gizmo bar to 旋转 and drag the ring; Ctrl turns in 15 degree steps. Copy. Alt+drag makes a copy and moves it. Or press 复制 in the inspector. Onto the floor. 放到地面 in the inspector puts it exactly on the floor below - the inspector shows how high the feet are."},{"p":"k-entity-setzen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Place, move and turn entities","s":"须知","x":"网格 on the map toolbar snaps everything to 8 to 64 units while dragging and placing."},{"p":"k-entity-finden.html","a":"","t":"Find an entity and fly to it","s":"Find an entity and fly to it","x":""},{"p":"k-entity-finden.html","a":"schritte","t":"Find an entity and fly to it","s":"步骤","x":"Search. Type a name or class into the search box above the entity list, for example navgoal or kyle. Fly there. Double-click the row: the view flies to the entity and selects it. Hide groups. Click the eye in front of a group to hide it in the view; Alt+click shows only that group. 全部显示 brings everything back. Names on the map. 名称 on the map toolbar writes every name into the view."},{"p":"k-entity-felder.html","a":"","t":"Edit an entity's keys","s":"Edit an entity's keys","x":""},{"p":"k-entity-felder.html","a":"schritte","t":"Edit an entity's keys","s":"步骤","x":"Select the entity. Click it in the view or in the list. The inspector under the list shows its class in colour; hover over it for a description from the game code. General. 名称 is how scripts address it, 位置 and 朝向 (度) where it stands and faces. Keys. Under 字段, change values or add one with + 键. For a character, the ... next to NPC_type searches every NPC of the game. Script keys have 打开 to open the script. Everything as text. 全部键 (原始) shows all keys as plain text, like Hammer without SmartEdit."},{"p":"k-entity-felder.html","a":"tipps","t":"Edit an entity's keys","s":"须知","x":"Entity changes are kept with the mission: 保存任务 writes them into the .ent file."},{"p":"k-draufsicht.html","a":"","t":"Look at the map from above","s":"Look at the map from above","x":""},{"p":"k-draufsicht.html","a":"schritte","t":"Look at the map from above","s":"步骤","x":"Switch on 俯视图 on the map toolbar. The view looks straight down; the wheel zooms, right or middle mouse and W A S D move. Cut away ceilings. Drag the cut height box at the top right: everything higher is not drawn. Lower it to look at a lower floor. Work as usual. Selecting, dragging and placing work in the top view too - handy for paths and waypoints."},{"p":"k-hell.html","a":"","t":"See better in dark maps","s":"See better in dark maps","x":""},{"p":"k-hell.html","a":"schritte","t":"See better in dark maps","s":"步骤","x":"Open 视图设置 (the gear on the map toolbar). 亮度 lightens everything, 环境光 lifts only the darkest areas - 0 is exactly like the game. Switch things off. 雾, 特效, 发光 and 天空 on the toolbar switch those parts off. Without the sky you can look into the map from outside. Only this script. 突出显示此脚本的实体 in the view settings dims every entity the active script does not use."},{"p":"k-tuer.html","a":"","t":"A door that opens","s":"A door that opens","x":""},{"p":"k-tuer.html","a":"schritte","t":"A door that opens","s":"步骤","x":"Select the door. Click it in the view - doors and platforms are func_ entities. In the inspector press 动画. Mode. In the 动画 window keep 脚本 (move): the movement becomes move commands in the script. First key. Put the playhead where the door should start moving and press 在播放头添加关键帧 - this is the closed position. Second key. Move the playhead later (for example 2 seconds) and drag the door up or aside in the view: while the window is open, dragging sets a key at the playhead. Play. The door now opens in the timeline. 线性 makes it move at constant speed instead of easing out."},{"p":"k-tuer.html","a":"tipps","t":"A door that opens","s":"须知","x":"Animated entities need a name; behaved gives the door one if it has none."},{"p":"k-roff-bearbeiten.html","a":"","t":"Change a ROFF file of the game","s":"Change a ROFF file of the game","x":""},{"p":"k-roff-bearbeiten.html","a":"schritte","t":"Change a ROFF file of the game","s":"步骤","x":"Select the entity that plays the ROFF (a ship, a boulder) and press 动画. Edit. Under 此实体在脚本中的 ROFF 路径: press 编辑 next to the file. behaved turns the frames into a few keys - the game file stays untouched, you edit a copy with its own name. Change the keys. Drag the diamonds in the view, change times in the table, add keys with 在播放头添加关键帧. Save. Saving the script writes scripts/.rof; 保存任务 puts it into the .pk3. Building a ROFF from scratch: . The details: ."},{"p":"k-graph.html","a":"","t":"Connect a character to a script","s":"Connect a character to a script","x":""},{"p":"k-graph.html","a":"schritte","t":"Connect a character to a script","s":"步骤","x":"Open the Graph. Above the script column, switch from 经典 to 图表. Every entity and script of the mission is a node. Drag a wire. Drag from the dot on the right of a character node to a script node. Choose when. A menu asks 连接为: spawnscript (when it appears), deathscript, usescript and more. behaved writes the key into the entity. New script. Drag a command from the 事件 list onto empty space in the graph: a new script with that command is made."},{"p":"k-mission-weiter.html","a":"","t":"Continue and pack a mission","s":"Continue and pack a mission","x":""},{"p":"k-mission-weiter.html","a":"schritte","t":"Continue and pack a mission","s":"步骤","x":"Open it again. 文件 → 最近的任务, or the list on the start page of the 任务 tab, opens map, entities and every script with one click. 打开任务文件夹 opens one from its folder. Work. Change scripts and entities. A dot next to the mission name means unsaved changes. Save mission. 保存任务 shows every file it will pack and checks the mission: errors in red (they must be fixed), warnings in orange. Pack. Press 保存: scripts are saved and compiled, the .ent written and the .pk3 packed. Start the game with devmap ."},{"p":"k-wegpunkte.html","a":"","t":"Give NPCs paths to walk","s":"Give NPCs paths to walk","x":""},{"p":"k-wegpunkte.html","a":"schritte","t":"Give NPCs paths to walk","s":"步骤","x":"Open the window. NPC 路径点 on the map toolbar. 显示路网 shows the network: green by hand, blue automatic, orange jumps. Create automatically. Press 生成路网: waypoints are spread over the walkable floor and connected. The spacing slider sets how dense (the original levels use about 230). Check. 检查路网 finds what the game would reject - click a problem to fly there. By hand. 放置路径点: click the floor to place a path; 连接 connects two points (Ctrl: a jump). More in ."},{"p":"k-modell.html","a":"","t":"Look at a character model","s":"Look at a character model","x":""},{"p":"k-modell.html","a":"schritte","t":"Look at a character model","s":"步骤","x":"Switch to 模型 in the mode bar. Pick a character. NPC lists every character of the game - type to search, click to load it with its skin. Look around. Left mouse turns, middle mouse moves, the wheel zooms. 转台 turns it by itself, 适应视图 brings it back to the front. Details. 皮肤 switches skins, 骨骼 shows the skeleton, 纹理 switches textures off."},{"p":"k-variablen.html","a":"","t":"Only the first time: variables and if","s":"Only the first time: variables and if","x":""},{"p":"k-variablen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Only the first time: variables and if","s":"步骤","x":"Declare once. In a script that runs only once - the intro, a spawn script - insert declare, choose FLOAT and type a name, for example seen. A declared variable starts at 0; a map can hold 16 of them. Ask with if. In the script that may run more often (a trigger's script, see ) insert if. In the editor press 助手 on the first value and build get ( FLOAT, \"seen\" ) with Get; as comparison choose =, as the other value 0. Do it inside. Put the commands of the scene into the if block. An else right after it runs when the scene was already seen. Remember. At the end of the if block insert set with the variable name seen and the value 1 - next time the if is false. Free it with free ( \"seen\" ) when it is no longer needed, so the name is available again."},{"p":"k-variablen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Only the first time: variables and if","s":"须知","x":"Comparisons are =,  and ! (not equal) - behaved warns about anything else."},{"p":"k-patrouille.html","a":"","t":"A guard walks his round","s":"A guard walks his round","x":""},{"p":"k-patrouille.html","a":"schritte","t":"A guard walks his round","s":"步骤","x":"Place the round. In the 任务 tab place three or four walk targets with the tile 行走目标 (waypoint_navgoal) (Shift places several) and name them round1, round2, round3. The guard. Place a character (角色 (NPC_spawner)), name it guard, and give it an affect ( \"guard\", FLUSH ) block in the script. Inside, insert the macro walkOnly first. The loop. Insert loop and keep -1 - forever. One leg per point. Inside the loop: a task with set ( SET_NAVGOAL, round1 ), then dowait for it, then wait ( 2000 ). Copy these three lines for each point and change the name. Play the timeline - the guard walks the round. Run instead. Replace walkOnly with runOnly - or right-click a walk target on the path and choose 奔跑(从此段起)."},{"p":"k-patrouille.html","a":"tipps","t":"A guard walks his round","s":"须知","x":"The macros patrolRun, patrolNoChase and patrolWalkNoChase set how a patrolling guard reacts to enemies."},{"p":"k-kamera-folgen.html","a":"","t":"Let the camera follow a figure","s":"Let the camera follow a figure","x":""},{"p":"k-kamera-folgen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Let the camera follow a figure","s":"步骤","x":"Put the figure into a group. In the figure's affect block insert set ( SET_CAMERA_GROUP, \"hero\" ). Follow. After the camera shot insert camera and choose FOLLOW: the group hero, a turning speed (for example 100) and 1 to blend into it. The camera now keeps turning towards the figure. Keep a distance. camera ( DISTANCE, 200, 1 ) keeps the camera 200 units from the group, moving with it. Watch it. Play the timeline: the Follow row under 摄像机 shows how long it lasts, and the view turns with the figure."},{"p":"k-kamera-folgen.html","a":"tipps","t":"Let the camera follow a figure","s":"须知","x":"SET_CAMERA_GROUP_Z_OFS aims higher or lower on the followed figure."},{"p":"k-video-text.html","a":"","t":"Show a video or a line of text","s":"Show a video or a line of text","x":""},{"p":"k-video-text.html","a":"schritte","t":"Show a video or a line of text","s":"步骤","x":"A video. Insert set and choose SET_VIDEO_PLAY; as the value type the name of a film in video/ without its ending - Jedi Academy plays .roq files this way, for example its intro jk0101_sw. Fade it. SET_VIDEO_FADE_IN and SET_VIDEO_FADE_OUT (true) set before the video let it fade. Text. print ( \"Three days later...\" ) shows a line in the middle of the screen."},{"p":"k-video-text.html","a":"tipps","t":"Show a video or a line of text","s":"须知","x":"behaved does not play videos in the timeline; it shows the command as a block so the timing stays visible."},{"p":"k-kampf.html","a":"","t":"Start a fight after the cutscene","s":"Start a fight after the cutscene","x":""},{"p":"k-kampf.html","a":"schritte","t":"Start a fight after the cutscene","s":"步骤","x":"Calm at first. Give the enemy a spawn script (key spawnscript, 打开 creates it) with the macro standOnly - he stands and ignores enemies. The scene. The cutscene runs as usual; the enemy can walk and talk like any figure. End the camera. At the end of the intro: camera ( DISABLE ) - the player plays again. Attack. Right after it, an affect ( \"enemy\", FLUSH ) block with set ( SET_IGNOREENEMIES, false ), set ( SET_LOOK_FOR_ENEMIES, true ) and set ( SET_ENEMY, \"player\" ). The macro default resets all behaviour in one line. More than one. Copy the block for each enemy, or put the lines into a script of their own and start it with run."},{"p":"k-kampf.html","a":"tipps","t":"Start a fight after the cutscene","s":"须知","x":"SET_BEHAVIOR_STATE with BS_DEFAULT gives the figure back to its normal AI after scripted walking."},{"p":"k-spieler-sperren.html","a":"","t":"Hold the player during a talk","s":"Hold the player during a talk","x":""},{"p":"k-spieler-sperren.html","a":"schritte","t":"Hold the player during a talk","s":"步骤","x":"Lock. Insert affect ( \"player\", FLUSH ) and inside it set ( SET_PLAYER_LOCKED, true ). SET_LOCK_PLAYER_WEAPONS keeps the weapon as well. Talk. The other figures speak and move as usual; the player watches from his own view. Free. At the end the same block with false - otherwise the player stays frozen."},{"p":"k-spieler-sperren.html","a":"tipps","t":"Hold the player during a talk","s":"须知","x":"With camera ( ENABLE ) the game takes the controls away by itself; the lock is for moments without a cutscene camera."},{"p":"k-lichtschwert.html","a":"","t":"Ignite a lightsaber in a scene","s":"Ignite a lightsaber in a scene","x":""},{"p":"k-lichtschwert.html","a":"schritte","t":"Ignite a lightsaber in a scene","s":"步骤","x":"The weapon. In the figure's affect block (or its spawn script): set ( SET_WEAPON, WP_SABER ). On. Where it should ignite: set ( SET_SABERACTIVE, true ). In the timeline the blade appears at that moment - with its sound when 声音 is on. Off. set ( SET_SABERACTIVE, false )."},{"p":"k-lichtschwert.html","a":"tipps","t":"Ignite a lightsaber in a scene","s":"须知","x":"SET_SABER1 gives the figure another saber by its name from the game's saber files."},{"p":"k-trigger.html","a":"","t":"Start a scene when the player walks somewhere","s":"Start a scene when the player walks somewhere","x":""},{"p":"k-trigger.html","a":"schritte","t":"Start a scene when the player walks somewhere","s":"步骤","x":"A runner. In the 任务 tab click the tile 脚本运行器 (target_scriptrunner) and click near the place. behaved names it and sets its usescript to a script in your mission folder. Its script. In the inspector press 打开 next to usescript: the script is created and opened. Write the scene in it. Find a trigger. Triggers are brushes of the map: type trigger into the search box of the entity list and pick one where the player passes. Fly there with a double-click. Point it at the runner. In the trigger's inspector set its key target to the runner's name. The 图表 view now shows the arrow from trigger to runner to script. Once or every time. A runner runs once; its key count set to -1 runs it every time. For only-the-first-time logic see ."},{"p":"k-trigger.html","a":"tipps","t":"Start a scene when the player walks somewhere","s":"须知","x":"New trigger areas need brushes, which are made in a map editor - behaved can change every trigger of a map, but not draw a new one. A script can also start a runner directly with use."},{"p":"k-tuer-use.html","a":"","t":"Open a door from the script","s":"Open a door from the script","x":""},{"p":"k-tuer-use.html","a":"schritte","t":"Open a door from the script","s":"步骤","x":"Find the door. Doors are in the group Movable (func_*) of the entity list. Click one to see it in the inspector. Its name. The door needs a targetname. A door with a name waits to be used instead of opening when someone walks up - which is what a scripted door should do. Insert use. Select the line in the script after which the door should open, then right-click the door in the entity list → 插入 use: use ( \"door1\" ) is inserted. Hear it. The door plays its own sounds (its soundSet). Play the timeline to check the moment."},{"p":"k-tuer-use.html","a":"tipps","t":"Open a door from the script","s":"须知","x":"Moving the door yourself instead - other distance, other speed: ."},{"p":"k-levelwechsel.html","a":"","t":"Go to the next map at the end","s":"Go to the next map at the end","x":""},{"p":"k-levelwechsel.html","a":"schritte","t":"Go to the next map at the end","s":"步骤","x":"Place it. + 实体 → 切换关卡 (target_level_change). In the inspector set mapname to the next map (for example taspir2) and give it a 名称 such as next_map. Use it. At the end of the script: use ( \"next_map\" ) (right-click the entity → 插入 use). Check it. 保存任务 warns when a target points to nothing; play the mission to see the loading screen."},{"p":"k-effekt-musik.html","a":"","t":"Add an effect and change the music","s":"Add an effect and change the music","x":""},{"p":"k-effekt-musik.html","a":"schritte","t":"Add an effect and change the music","s":"步骤","x":"An effect. Click the tile 特效 (fx_runner) and click where it should appear. In the inspector set fxFile to an effect of the game (a path under effects/, for example env/fire), give it a name, and tick STARTOFF so it waits. Start it. In the script: use ( \"fire1\" ) at the right moment. 特效 on the toolbar shows effects in the view. Music. + 实体 → 音乐 (target_play_music), set music to a music file and a name; use it from the script to switch the music. Dynamic music. set ( SET_MUSIC_STATE, ... ) switches the game's own music between its states, for example to action."},{"p":"k-szene-aendern.html","a":"","t":"Change a cutscene of the game","s":"Change a cutscene of the game","x":""},{"p":"k-szene-aendern.html","a":"schritte","t":"Change a cutscene of the game","s":"步骤","x":"Open it. 文件 → 加载任务…, choose assets0.pk3 in the game's base folder and pick a map, for example taspir1. The map and all its scripts open in tabs. Find the scene. In the 任务 tab, Scripts (N) lists the scripts the map uses - pick the intro. The timeline shows its camera. Change a shot. Select a shot in the 镜头 list, fly to a better view and press 设为当前视角 - or change a time in the timeline. Pack it. 保存任务 writes the changed scripts with the map into zz_.pk3. Archives load in alphabetical order, so zz_ wins over the game's own files. Undo it. Delete the zz_ file from the game folder and the game plays its original again - the game files are never touched."},{"p":"k-multiplayer.html","a":"","t":"Check a script for multiplayer","s":"Check a script for multiplayer","x":""},{"p":"k-multiplayer.html","a":"schritte","t":"Check a script for multiplayer","s":"步骤","x":"Switch. 视图 → 目标游戏 → multiplayer. An MP badge appears in the status line. Read the notes. Click the notes counter in the status line: the 消息 window lists every command that does nothing or works differently on a server - checked against the multiplayer game code. Switch back to single player when you are done; the script itself is not changed."},{"p":"k-oberflaeche.html","a":"","t":"Set up the program your way","s":"Set up the program your way","x":""},{"p":"k-oberflaeche.html","a":"schritte","t":"Set up the program your way","s":"步骤","x":"Shortcuts. 编辑 → 键盘快捷键: click a shortcut, press the new key. Esc cancels, Backspace clears; a clash shows which action already has the key. Theme and language. 视图 → 主题 (six themes, among them BehavEd Classic and High Contrast) and 语言. Size. 视图 → 界面缩放, or Ctrl+mouse wheel anywhere outside the timeline. Columns. Drag the dividers between the columns; each mode keeps its own widths. 调试 → Restore default layout brings them back. The guide. F1 opens this guide - also rebindable. All settings: . All keys: ."},{"p":"k-tod.html","a":"","t":"When the enemy dies, the door opens","s":"When the enemy dies, the door opens","x":""},{"p":"k-tod.html","a":"schritte","t":"When the enemy dies, the door opens","s":"步骤","x":"Give the figure a deathscript. Select the enemy in the 任务 tab. In the inspector add the key deathscript with a script name of your mission, for example taspir_tut/rosh_dies - or, in the 图表 view, drag a wire from the figure to a script and choose deathscript under 连接为. Create the script. Press 打开 next to the key: the script is created in the mission folder and opened. Open the door. In it, insert use with the door's name - right-click the door in the entity list → 插入 use does it for you. A wait before it lets the moment breathe. Other moments. The same works with painscript (hit), awakescript (notices the player), angerscript (starts fighting), fleescript and spawnscript."},{"p":"k-ansprechen.html","a":"","t":"The player talks to a figure","s":"The player talks to a figure","x":""},{"p":"k-ansprechen.html","a":"schritte","t":"The player talks to a figure","s":"步骤","x":"Make it usable. In the figure's spawn script insert set ( SET_PLAYER_USABLE, true ) - otherwise the use key does nothing. The script for the talk. Add the key usescript to the figure (or connect it in the 图表 view as usescript) and press 打开. Write the talk. Sounds on CHAN_VOICE, a SET_LOOK_TARGET at the player, perhaps a short camera. The figure says its lines every time the player presses use. Only once? Set SET_PLAYER_USABLE to false at the end of the usescript - or use a variable ()."},{"p":"k-zusammenspiel.html","a":"","t":"Let several scripts work together","s":"Let several scripts work together","x":""},{"p":"k-zusammenspiel.html","a":"schritte","t":"Let several scripts work together","s":"步骤","x":"Split the work. Long scenes are easier in parts: the intro starts the next part with run ( \"taspir_tut/talk\" ) - the name as under scripts/, without ending. Hand over. Where the intro must wait for the other part, insert waitsignal ( \"talk_done\" ); at the end of the other script signal ( \"talk_done\" ). See both. 文件 → 分屏 → 2 shows the two scripts side by side; drag lines across to copy them. Keep the overview. The 图表 view draws run connections between the scripts of the mission."},{"p":"k-pruefen.html","a":"","t":"Fix what Save mission reports","s":"Fix what Save mission reports","x":""},{"p":"k-pruefen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Fix what Save mission reports","s":"步骤","x":"Open the check. 保存任务 lists every file it will pack and, below, what it found. Errors in red stop the packing until they are fixed; warnings in orange let you pack anyway - but read them. S001 (warning) - a script is missing. An entity names a script that does not exist yet; in the game nothing would happen. Select the entity and press 打开 next to the key: the script is created. S002 (error) - a script does not compile. Open it and press 编译！: the wrong line is selected (). S003 (warning) - no player start. The mission cannot start. Place one with the tile 玩家出生点 (info_player_start). S005 (warning) - a target points to nothing. A target names an entity that does not exist - often a leftover of the original map, like the one in the picture. S004 and S006. A missing ENDMARKER is added for you (warning); an invalid mission name is an error - letters, digits and _ only."},{"p":"k-ibi.html","a":"","t":"Open a compiled script of the game","s":"Open a compiled script of the game","x":""},{"p":"k-ibi.html","a":"schritte","t":"Open a compiled script of the game","s":"步骤","x":"Find it. 文件 → 浏览 .pk3…, choose 脚本 and type part of the name into 筛选, for example taspir1/intro. Open it. Double-click the entry: the .ibi opens as a script in the current tab - commands, values and blocks, exactly as Raven wrote them. Open an empty tab first (+) if you want to keep the script you are working on; with unsaved changes behaved asks before. From disk. 文件 → 打开 opens .ibi files from a folder the same way. Change it. A script from an archive has no file yet - the first save asks where to put it. To ship a changed version of a game scene, see ."},{"p":"k-pk3.html","a":"","t":"Find files in the game archives","s":"Find files in the game archives","x":""},{"p":"k-pk3.html","a":"schritte","t":"Find files in the game archives","s":"步骤","x":"Open the browser. 文件 → 浏览 .pk3…. It lists the files of every game folder you added. Choose the kind. 脚本, 地图 or 模型. The 归档 list narrows it to one .pk3. Search. Type into 筛选 - part of a name is enough. Open. Double-click: a script replaces the one in the current tab (behaved asks first if it has unsaved changes), a map loads, a model opens with its skin in the 模型 tab."},{"p":"k-aenderungen.html","a":"","t":"See what you have changed","s":"See what you have changed","x":""},{"p":"k-aenderungen.html","a":"schritte","t":"See what you have changed","s":"步骤","x":"The margin. Change a value: a coloured bar appears left of the line - orange for changed and not saved, green for changed and saved, blue for back to the original. 视图 → 更改历史（边栏） switches it on or off. What was it before? Hover over the bar: the original line is shown. Back to the original. Right-click the line → 恢复为原始: only this command goes back, everything else stays. Identical commands. 视图 → 高亮相同的命令 marks every command that looks exactly like the selected one - handy for a camera that is used several times."},{"p":"k-backup.html","a":"","t":"Get an old version back","s":"Get an old version back","x":""},{"p":"k-backup.html","a":"schritte","t":"Get an old version back","s":"步骤","x":"Automatic copies. Every save and every compile keeps a copy - the last ten, backup1.txt (newest) to backup10.txt. 文件 → 打开备份文件夹 opens the folder. Your own backup. 备份 (Alt+B) writes .bak next to the script - before a big change. Restore it. 还原 (Alt+R) goes back to the .bak, after a question. Smaller steps. For the last few changes the undo history is quicker: ."},{"p":"k-meldungen.html","a":"","t":"Understand the warnings","s":"Understand the warnings","x":""},{"p":"k-meldungen.html","a":"schritte","t":"Understand the warnings","s":"步骤","x":"The counters. The status line counts errors and notes. Click a counter to open the 消息 window. Read them. Each message names its code and the command. A misspelt value such as SET_WALKNG is reported as *not in SET_TYPES (kept unchanged)* - behaved keeps it, because mods bring their own values, but it is far more often a typo. Fix and check. Correct the value in the editor - the message disappears. Messages never change the script by themselves."},{"p":"k-gruppe.html","a":"","t":"Move many entities at once","s":"Move many entities at once","x":""},{"p":"k-gruppe.html","a":"schritte","t":"Move many entities at once","s":"步骤","x":"Draw a frame. In the 任务 tab drag over empty space in the view: every entity inside is selected. Ctrl or Shift adds to it. Move the group. Drag one of them, or use the arrows: all move together. Turn the group. Switch the gizmo bar to 旋转 and drag the ring. Copy it. Alt+drag copies the whole group - 复制 in the inspector does the same."},{"p":"k-blickpunkte.html","a":"","t":"Remember viewpoints and camera paths","s":"Remember viewpoints and camera paths","x":""},{"p":"k-blickpunkte.html","a":"schritte","t":"Remember viewpoints and camera paths","s":"步骤","x":"Store a view. With the mouse over the map press Ctrl+1 … 9; the status line confirms it. 1 … 9 jumps back. The views are kept per map. All paths or one. In the camera panel, 全部路径 draws every camera move of the script, 当前路径 only the one around the playhead - clearer in long scenes. Fly to a shot. 飞到镜头 puts your view next to the selected shot."},{"p":"k-spawnflags.html","a":"","t":"A figure that appears on cue","s":"A figure that appears on cue","x":""},{"p":"k-spawnflags.html","a":"schritte","t":"A figure that appears on cue","s":"步骤","x":"Two names. A character spawner has NPC_targetname - the name of the figure, used by affect - and may have targetname - the name of the spawner itself. Wait for the cue. Give the spawner a targetname, for example rosh_spawner. In the game it then spawns its figure only when it is used. Call it. In the script: use ( \"rosh_spawner\" ) - from then on the figure exists and affect ( \"rosh\" ) reaches it. (The preview shows the figure from the start.) Spawnflags. The checkboxes under 生成标志 set the class's options; hover over one for what it does."},{"p":"k-ent.html","a":"","t":"Load a separate .ent file","s":"Load a separate .ent file","x":""},{"p":"k-ent.html","a":"schritte","t":"Load a separate .ent file","s":"步骤","x":"Open it. 地图和文件 → 打开 .ent… loads an .ent file: its entities replace the ones of the map. Work as usual. The entities appear in the list and the view; change them like any other. Saved with the mission. 保存任务 writes the entities into maps/.ent in the .pk3 - the game loads it instead of the map's own."},{"p":"k-spuren.html","a":"","t":"Time a scene in the Tracks view","s":"Time a scene in the Tracks view","x":""},{"p":"k-spuren.html","a":"schritte","t":"Time a scene in the Tracks view","s":"步骤","x":"Switch to Tracks. Above the script column choose 轨道: rows for 摄像机, each figure, 对白 and 脚本. Jump to a line. Click a block: its line is selected. Change a duration. Drag the right edge of a block. Move through time. Drag in the ruler; 播放 plays."},{"p":"k-zeitleiste-plus.html","a":"","t":"The timeline in detail","s":"The timeline in detail","x":""},{"p":"k-zeitleiste-plus.html","a":"schritte","t":"The timeline in detail","s":"步骤","x":"Waits as blocks. 等待 shows every wait as its own block - drag it to change it directly. Quiet rows. 空闲轨道 also shows the rows where nothing happens after the start. Frames. Click the time display to switch between seconds and frames. Speed. The list next to the play button plays at 0.25x to 2x; sound only at 1x. Overlap warning. A warning sign on a camera block: it overlaps the next move. In the game the next one starts from where this one began, and the camera jumps - shorten one of them."},{"p":"k-skins.html","a":"","t":"Skins and skeletons of a model","s":"Skins and skeletons of a model","x":""},{"p":"k-skins.html","a":"schritte","t":"Skins and skeletons of a model","s":"步骤","x":"Switch skins. In the 模型 tab the 皮肤 list shows the skins that come with the model; 打开 .skin… loads another one. Surfaces. The counter of surfaces shows how many the skin draws; click it to list them all in the detail log. Caps. 显示封盖 shows the _off surfaces that close the holes where limbs attach. Another skeleton. 加载 .gla… loads a different .gla with its animations."},{"p":"einstellungen.html","a":"","t":"设置与更新","s":"设置与更新","x":""},{"p":"einstellungen.html","a":"spielordner","t":"设置与更新","s":"游戏文件夹","x":"编辑 → 游戏目录 列出程序读取其 .pk3 的文件夹,每个都有 上移、下移、移除 和 打开。最下面的优先于上面所有文件夹,正如引擎中 fs_game 覆盖 base。没有压缩包的文件夹会给出提示——说明路径不对。 游戏文件夹。"},{"p":"einstellungen.html","a":"prefs","t":"设置与更新","s":"首选项","x":"编辑 → 首选项(或操作栏中的 首选项,Alt+P)包含原版 BehavEd 的选项: 目录:脚本路径、命令描述文件(定义所有命令的 .bhc——重新加载命令模型 重新读取)、源文件路径。 启动时重新打开上次的文件、下拉列表按字母排序、使用备用配色图标、打开/新建/退出时询问、文件对话框默认使用上次的目录。 语言、主题和界面大小位于 视图 菜单。"},{"p":"einstellungen.html","a":"tasten","t":"设置与更新","s":"修改快捷键","x":"编辑 → 键盘快捷键 列出所有带快捷键的操作。单击某个快捷键,再按新键;Esc 取消,Backspace 清除。已被占用的键会提示。默认值见 。"},{"p":"einstellungen.html","a":"updates","t":"设置与更新","s":"更新与更新日志","x":"帮助 → 检查更新 会向 GitHub 查询新版本并显示更新内容;下载并安装 会替换程序文件并提示重启。旁边的开关决定是否在启动时检查。帮助 → 更新日志 按版本以你的语言显示修复和新增的内容——更新后会自动打开一次。"},{"p":"tasten.html","a":"","t":"键盘快捷键","s":"键盘快捷键","x":""},{"p":"tasten.html","a":"skript","t":"键盘快捷键","s":"脚本","x":"编辑所选命令 Enter 插入在事件列表中选中的命令 Insert 删除 Delete 复制一份 Space 复制 Ctrl+C 剪切(也可 Ctrl+T) Ctrl+X 粘贴 Ctrl+V REM:注释/取消(Ctrl+Backspace:取消注释) Backspace 上移(Alt+Down:下移),保持在同一块中 Alt+Up 撤销(Ctrl+Y 或 Ctrl+Shift+Z:重做) Ctrl+Z 查找;F3 / Shift+F3 下一个/上一个 Ctrl+F 切换书签;F2 / Shift+F2 下一个/上一个 Ctrl+F2 展开项及其子项(Ctrl+Num+:全部) Num+ 折叠项(Ctrl+Num-:全部) Num-"},{"p":"tasten.html","a":"datei","t":"键盘快捷键","s":"文件","x":"打开本手册 F1 打开 Ctrl+O 保存 Ctrl+S 另存为(与原版 BehavEd 相同) Ctrl+A 全部保存 Ctrl+Shift+S 备份;Alt+R 恢复 Alt+B 最近打开的文件 Alt+M 首选项;Alt+X 退出 Alt+P"},{"p":"tasten.html","a":"karte","t":"键盘快捷键","s":"地图与摄像机","x":"飞行(鼠标位于视图上);Q / E 下降/上升,Shift 加速;鼠标右键环顾四周 W A S D 保存视角 1(…9);1…9 跳回 Ctrl+1 拖动实体时:圆环以 15 度为一步;设置了网格时关闭网格,未设置时箭头吸附到 8 单位 Ctrl Alt+拖动实体:先复制 Alt 拖动飞行目标或关键帧菱形时:仅上下 Shift 取消放置、路径点工具或驾驶 Esc 驾驶时:在播放头处设置摄像机关键帧 Enter"},{"p":"tasten.html","a":"zeit","t":"键盘快捷键","s":"时间轴","x":"后退/前进 50 毫秒,鼠标位于时间轴上(Shift:1 秒) 左 / 右 跳到开头/结尾(鼠标位于时间轴上) Home / End 拖动块时:只移动此块 Alt"},{"p":"tasten.html","a":"fenster","t":"键盘快捷键","s":"窗口","x":"界面大小(在时间轴轨道上:缩放时间轴) Ctrl + 滚轮"},{"p":"begriffe.html","a":"","t":"术语表","s":"术语表","x":"ICARUS 游戏的脚本系统。脚本是文本(.txt),以编译后的形式(.ibi)运行。 .ibi 编译后的脚本——游戏真正运行的文件。由 编译！ 生成。 .bhc 命令描述文件:所有命令、其字段及可选值。 affect 其中命令发送给某个指定角色或实体的块。 task / do / dowait 命名的命令组;do 并行启动,dowait 等待其完成。 wait 以毫秒计的暂停。游戏中会比写入值晚一帧(50 毫秒)结束。 SET_NAVGOAL 让角色走向某个 waypoint_navgoal。 NPC_spawner 使角色出现的实体;NPC_type 指定角色种类,NPC_targetname 为脚本提供名字。 ref_tag 地图中的命名标记——用于摄像机位置和注视目标。 target_scriptrunner 被使用时(由触发器、其他实体或脚本)运行脚本。 func_static 脚本可以移动的地图笔刷模型——飞船、门、平台。 ROFF (.rof) 记录下来的运动:每个游戏帧一小步位置和角度变化。参见 。 .pk3 游戏从中读取文件的 zip 压缩包。任务会打包成一个 .pk3。 .ent 单独文件中的地图实体;Movie Duels 保留原地图,并在旁边放置自己的实体。 Movie Duels 一个大型《绝地学院》模组,包含带过场动画的任务——本程序的主要用途。"},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"","t":"Every button","s":"Every button","x":"Hover over any button in the program to see the same explanation as a tooltip. Buttons with a coloured frame are switches: on or off."},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"modus","t":"Every button","s":"The mode bar","x":"The strip at the far left switches what the window shows. The script stays the same in every mode. 事件 The 事件 list of every command and macro, the script tree, the action column - for writing scripts.  任务 The mission: the entity list and inspector, the map in 3D with the timeline below - for cameras, figures, entities and saving the mission.  模型 A character model with its animations - to find an animation and put it into the script. "},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"aktionen","t":"Every button","s":"The action column (Events mode)","x":"The action column, as in the original BehavEd. 删除 Removes the selected lines (Delete). 克隆 Inserts a copy right below (Space). 复制 / 剪切 / 粘贴 Clipboard (Ctrl+C / X / V). Paste goes below the selection; text from other programs is accepted after a question. 注释掉 Turns lines into comments and back (Backspace). 查找 The Find window (Ctrl+F): search by command or value, replace in one or all scripts.  上移 / 下移 Moves the selection one line, inside its block (Alt+Up/Down). 撤销 / やり直し Undo and redo. Right-click either one for the full history.  新建 / 打开 An empty script / open a .txt or a compiled .ibi. 最近 Recently opened files (Alt+M). 追加 Adds another script to the end of this one. 保存 / 全部保存 / 另存为 Save this script, every changed tab, or under a new name. 导出 Writes the script as plain text and opens it. 备份 / 还原 Keeps a copy next to the script (.bak) / goes back to it (Alt+B / Alt+R). 显示类型 Shows the value types in the tree. %g 浮点数 Shows numbers short: 1000 instead of 1000.000. 折叠宏 Shows a macro as one line. + / - Expands or collapses every block. 编译！ Saves the script and writes the .ibi the game runs; green when it worked, red with the messages when not. "},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"kartenleiste","t":"Every button","s":"The map toolbar (Mission mode)","x":"The toolbar above the map.  新建任务 Starts a mission on any map: player start, script runner, intro script and mission folder are created.   加载任务… Opens a mission from a .pk3: map, entities, every script in tabs, the figures.   保存任务 Saves every script, writes the .ent, compiles and packs the .pk3 - after checking the mission.   没有任务 The name of the open mission; a dot means unsaved changes. Hover for its folder.  地图和文件 Opens a map from disk or from a .pk3, a mission folder, or a separate .ent file. 脚本 The scripts the map's entities point to - pick one to open it.  实体 Shows the entity markers: walk targets, marks, runners, spawners.  名称 Writes the names of entities and figures into the view.  角色 Shows the script's figures, moved by the timeline.  特效 Shows the effects of the map (fx_runner).  发光 The glow of shaders marked glow, as r_DynamicGlow.  动态光 Lightsabers and effect lights light up walls and figures.  雾 The fog of the map, as the game draws it.  天空 The sky; switched off you can look into the map from outside.  通过摄像机 Shows what the camera sees - the selected camera command, or the camera at the playhead.   俯视图 Looks straight down; a cut height hides ceilings.   NPC 路径点 The NPC waypoint window: show, create and check the network.   网格 Snaps entities to 8 to 64 units while dragging and placing.  视图设置 Brightness, ambient light, detail, shadows, highlighting the active script's entities.   统计 Frame rate, textures, triangles and graphics card values."},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"kacheln","t":"Every button","s":"The placement tiles","x":"The strip on the left edge of the map. Click a tile, then click on the floor - or drag the tile into the view. Shift places several, Esc stops.   角色 (NPC_spawner) A character that spawns: set NPC_type and a name.  行走目标 (waypoint_navgoal) A place a figure walks to (SET_NAVGOAL).  摄像机/注视标记 (ref_tag) A mark with a direction - for cameras (tag) and look targets.  注视目标 (target_position) A point to look at or to aim at.  脚本运行器 (target_scriptrunner) Runs a script when it is used - by a trigger, the player start or another script.  特效 (fx_runner) Plays an effect file (.efx).  声音 (target_speaker) Plays a sound, once or in a loop.  NPC 路径点 (waypoint) A point of the NPC navigation network.  玩家出生点 (info_player_start) Where the player spawns."},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"inspektor","t":"Every button","s":"The entity inspector","x":"The inspector under the entity list.  飞过去 Flies the view to the entity.  放到地面 Puts it on the floor below, like DROPTOFLOOR in the game.  复制 A copy - of every selected entity. Alt+drag in the view does the same.  删除 Removes it.  动画 Opens the Animation window for doors, platforms, ships and effects.   撤销 Undoes the last entity change (entities have their own history).  やり直し Redoes it.  全部键 (原始) Shows every key as plain text. + 键 Adds a key. 打开 Next to a script key: opens the script - and creates it in the mission folder if it does not exist yet."},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"kamera","t":"Every button","s":"The camera bar","x":"Appears in the view when the camera is selected.  The camera bar above the selected shot.  移动 Arrows: move the shot along one axis, the box in the middle in the view plane.  旋转 Rings: turn the shot. 世界 World or Local: the arrows follow the map axes or the camera.  上一个镜头 The previous shot.  下一个镜头 The next shot.  设为当前视角 Puts the shot where you are looking.  驾驶 Sit in the shot and fly it; Enter sets a key.   通过摄像机 Look through the camera.  摄像机预览 A small picture of the camera's view in the corner.  在此新建镜头 A new shot at your view, after the selected one.  删除镜头 Removes the shot."},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"zeitleiste","t":"Every button","s":"The timeline","x":"The transport bar of the timeline.  回到开头 Back to the start of the script.  播放 Plays the scene - camera, figures, sound - in game time.  循环 Starts again at the end.  声音 Plays the sounds while the timeline runs.  跟随 Moves the view along with the camera.  缩小 Shows more time.  放大 Shows less time, in more detail.  角色行 One row per figure: when each one walks, speaks and acts.  空闲轨道 Also shows rows where nothing happens.  等待 Shows the waits as their own blocks.  在此插入摄像机 Inserts a camera shot at the playhead. The time display switches between seconds and frames when you click it; the list next to the play button sets the speed. Drag blocks to move them in time - ."},{"p":"knoepfe.html","a":"modell","t":"Every button","s":"The model toolbar (Model mode)","x":"The toolbar above the model.  打开 .glm… Opens a .glm model from disk.  从 .pk3… Opens a model from the game's archives.  NPC Every character of the game - click one to load it as the game shows it.  打开 .skin… Loads a .skin for the model.  加载 .gla… Loads another skeleton / animation file (.gla).  转台 Turns the model slowly around itself.  骨骼 Shows the skeleton.  显示封盖 Shows the caps of the surfaces where limbs attach.  纹理 Textures on or off.  适应视图 The whole model in view, from the front.  复制 In the animation list: copies the animation name.  插入脚本 Puts set ( SET_ANIM_BOTH, ... ) for the animation into the script. "},{"p":"befehle.html","a":"","t":"Every command","s":"Every command","x":"Commands are inserted from the 事件 list (double-click, drag or Insert) and changed in the 事件编辑器 (double-click the line). Hover over a command in the list to read the help text the game's designers wrote for it. How to put them together: ."},{"p":"befehle.html","a":"liste","t":"Every command","s":"The commands of the Events list","x":"flush Clears every command still waiting for this entity - what an affect block with FLUSH does at its start. flush ( ) if / else Runs the block only if the comparison holds (=, , ! for *not equal*). else must follow right after an if. if ( $get( FLOAT, \"count\")$, $>$, $2$ ) loop Repeats its block; the number says how often, -1 means forever. loop ( 3 ) affect Sends the commands of its block to one entity - a figure, a ship, a door - by its name. FLUSH replaces what the entity was doing, INSERT adds to it. The script itself does not wait for the block. affect ( \"kyle\", FLUSH ) run Starts another script on the entity that runs this one. run ( \"taspir_tut/kyle_spawn\" ) wait Pauses for so many milliseconds - or, with a name, until that task is finished. wait ( 2000 ) waitsignal Pauses until some other script calls signal with the same name. Only one script can wait for a given signal. waitsignal ( \"door_open\" ) signal Wakes the script that waits for this name. signal ( \"door_open\" ) sound Plays a sound on a channel of the entity - CHAN_VOICE for dialogue, so the mouth moves. sound ( CHAN_VOICE, \"sound/chars/kyle/...\" ) move Moves an entity (a door, a platform, a ship) to a position - and, if given, to new angles - in so many milliseconds. The Animate window writes these for you (). move ( , , 2000 ) rotate Turns an entity to angles (pitch, yaw, roll) in so many milliseconds. rotate ( , 1000 ) use Uses an entity by name, as if the player pressed it - opens a door, fires a trigger. use ( \"door1\" ) kill Kills the entity with this name. kill ( \"stormie1\" ) remove Removes the entity with this name from the game. remove ( \"stormie1\" ) print Shows a text in the middle of the screen. print ( \"Hello\" ) rem A comment - does nothing in the game. 注释掉 turns any line into one. rem ( \"camera starts here\" ) declare / free Declares a variable (FLOAT, STRING, VECTOR; at most 16 per map) - free gives the name back. declare ( FLOAT, \"count\" ) set Changes a value: an entity field (SET_NAVGOAL, SET_ANIM_BOTH, ... - see the full list below) or a declared variable. set ( SET_WALKING, \"true\" ) camera Controls the cutscene camera; the first value chooses what it does - see the next section. camera ( ENABLE ) task Declares a named group of commands - it does not run yet. task ( \"walk\" ) do Starts a task and goes on at once. do ( \"walk\" ) dowait Starts a task and waits until it is done - for a walk: until the figure has arrived. dowait ( \"walk\" ) play Plays a ROFF file on the entity of the current affect block - a recorded movement. play ( PLAY_ROFF, \"taspir_tut/roffs/ravensClaw\" ) A command marked with * in its help text (for example SET_NAVGOAL) finishes its task only when the action is done - that is what lets dowait wait for it."},{"p":"befehle.html","a":"kamera","t":"Every command","s":"camera ( ... ) - the camera commands","x":"The first value of camera chooses the command. behaved shows every one of them in the timeline under 摄像机 and plays it in the view. Times are in milliseconds. ENABLE - Puts game in camera mode DISABLE - Takes game out of camera mode ZOOM number, whole number Normal is 80, 10 is zoomed in, max is 120.  Second value is time in ms to take to zoom to the new FOV MOVE vector, whole number Move to a absolute vector origin or TAG(\"targetname\", ORIGIN) over time over number of milliseconds PAN vector, vector, whole number Pan to absolute angle from current angle in dir (no dir will use shortest) over number of milliseconds ROLL number, whole number Roll to relative angle offsets of current angle over number of milliseconds TRACK text, number, whole number Get on track and move at speed, last number is whether or not to lerp to the start pos FOLLOW text, number, whole number Follow ents with matching cameraGroup at angleSpeed, last number is whether or not to lerp to the start angle DISTANCE number, whole number Keep this distance from cameraGroup (if any), last number is whether or not to lerp to the start angle FADE vector, number, vector, number, whole number Fade from [start Red Green Blue], [Opacity] to [end Red Green Blue], [Opacity] (all fields valid ranges are 0 to 1) over [number of milliseconds] SHAKE number, whole number Intensity (0-16) and duration, in milliseconds PATH text Path to ROF file"},{"p":"befehle.html","a":"makros","t":"Every command","s":"Macros","x":"At the end of the 事件 list. A macro inserts several set commands at once; 折叠宏 shows it as one line. standOnly simply stands, ignores enemies & alerts 3 walkOnly simply walks, ignores enemies & alerts 5 runOnly simply runs, ignores enemies & alerts 5 standNoAlerts simply stands, ignores alerts 2 walkNoAlerts simply walks, ignores alerts 4 runNoAlerts simply runs, ignores alerts 4 standNoEnemies simply stands, ignores enemies 2 walkNoEnemies simply walks, ignores enemies 4 runNoEnemies simply runs, ignores enemies 4 standGuardNoChase looks for enemies, shoots at but doesn't chase them 3 patrolRun patrols in a run, chases enemies 5 patrolNoChase patrols, sticks to patrol route even when shooting enemy 3 patrolWalkNoChase patrols in a walk, sticks to walking patrol route even when shooting enemy 5 patrolRunNoChase patrols in a run, sticks to running patrol route even when shooting enemy 5 default resets to default behavior 6"},{"p":"befehle.html","a":"set","t":"Every command","s":"set ( SET_... ) - every field","x":"All fields set can change, grouped as in the game's own list (Q3_Interface.h). The description is the one the editor shows - Raven's own words. Type part of a name into the search box of this guide to find a field. Parm strings SET_PARM1 text Set entity parm1 Parm strings SET_PARM2 text Set entity parm2 Parm strings SET_PARM3 text Set entity parm3 Parm strings SET_PARM4 text Set entity parm4 Parm strings SET_PARM5 text Set entity parm5 Parm strings SET_PARM6 text Set entity parm6 Parm strings SET_PARM7 text Set entity parm7 Parm strings SET_PARM8 text Set entity parm8 Parm strings SET_PARM9 text Set entity parm9 Parm strings SET_PARM10 text Set entity parm10 Parm strings SET_PARM11 text Set entity parm11 Parm strings SET_PARM12 text Set entity parm12 Parm strings SET_PARM13 text Set entity parm13 Parm strings SET_PARM14 text Set entity parm14 Parm strings SET_PARM15 text Set entity parm15 Parm strings SET_PARM16 text Set entity parm16 Scripts and other file paths SET_SPAWNSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when spawned //0 - do not change these, these are equal to BSET_SPAWN, etc Scripts and other file paths SET_USESCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when used Scripts and other file paths SET_AWAKESCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when startled Scripts and other file paths SET_ANGERSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script run when find an enemy for the first time Scripts and other file paths SET_ATTACKSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when you shoot Scripts and other file paths SET_VICTORYSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when killed someone Scripts and other file paths SET_LOSTENEMYSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when you can't find your enemy Scripts and other file paths SET_PAINSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when hit Scripts and other file paths SET_FLEESCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when hit and low health Scripts and other file paths SET_DEATHSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when killed Scripts and other file paths SET_DELAYEDSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run after a delay Scripts and other file paths SET_BLOCKEDSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when blocked by teammate Scripts and other file paths SET_FFIRESCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when player has shot own team repeatedly Scripts and other file paths SET_FFDEATHSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when player kills a teammate Scripts and other file paths SET_MINDTRICKSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when player kills a teammate Scripts and other file paths SET_VIDEO_PLAY text *.roq\" # Play a video (inGame) Scripts and other file paths SET_CINEMATIC_SKIPSCRIPT text *.txt\" # Script to run when skipping the running cinematic Scripts and other file paths SET_RAILCENTERTRACKLOCKED text Turn off the centered movers on the given track Scripts and other file paths SET_RAILCENTERTRACKUNLOCKED text Turn on the centered movers on the given track Scripts and other file paths SET_SKIN text just blindly sets whatever skin you set!  include full path after \"base/\"... eg: \"models/players/tavion_new/model_possessed.skin\" Standard strings SET_ENEMY text Set enemy by targetname Standard strings SET_LEADER text Set for BS_FOLLOW_LEADER Standard strings SET_NAVGOAL text *Move to this navgoal then continue script Standard strings SET_CAPTURE text Set captureGoal by targetname Standard strings SET_VIEWTARGET text Set angles toward ent by targetname Standard strings SET_WATCHTARGET text Set angles toward ent by targetname, will *continue* to face them... only in BS_CINEMATIC Standard strings SET_TARGETNAME text Set/change your targetname Standard strings SET_PAINTARGET text Set/change what to use when hit Standard strings SET_CAMERA_GROUP text all ents with this cameraGroup will be focused on Standard strings SET_CAMERA_GROUP_TAG text What tag on all clients to try to track Standard strings SET_LOOK_TARGET text object for NPC to look at Standard strings SET_ADDRHANDBOLT_MODEL text object to place on NPC right hand bolt Standard strings SET_REMOVERHANDBOLT_MODEL text object to remove from NPC right hand bolt Standard strings SET_ADDLHANDBOLT_MODEL text object to place on NPC left hand bolt Standard strings SET_REMOVELHANDBOLT_MODEL text object to remove from NPC left hand bolt Standard strings SET_CAPTIONTEXTCOLOR text Color of text RED,WHITE,BLUE, YELLOW Standard strings SET_CENTERTEXTCOLOR text Color of text RED,WHITE,BLUE, YELLOW Standard strings SET_SCROLLTEXTCOLOR text Color of text RED,WHITE,BLUE, YELLOW Standard strings SET_COPY_ORIGIN text Copy the origin of the ent with targetname to your origin Standard strings SET_DEFEND_TARGET text This NPC will attack the target NPC's enemies Standard strings SET_TARGET text Set/change your target Standard strings SET_TARGET2 text Set/change your target2, on NPC's, this fires when they're knocked out by the red hypo Standard strings SET_LOCATION text What trigger_location you're in - Can only be gotten, not set! Standard strings SET_REMOVE_TARGET text Target that is fired when someone completes the BS_REMOVE behaviorState Standard strings SET_LOADGAME text Load the savegame that was auto-saved when you started the holodeck Standard strings SET_LOCKYAW text Lock legs to a certain yaw angle (or \"off\" or \"auto\" uses current) Standard strings SET_VIEWENTITY text Make the player look through this ent's eyes - also shunts player movement control to this ent Standard strings SET_LOOPSOUND text sound\\*.*\" # Looping sound to play on entity Standard strings SET_ICARUS_FREEZE text Specify name of entity to freeze - !!!NOTE!!! since the ent is frozen, you must have some other entity unfreeze it!!! Standard strings SET_ICARUS_UNFREEZE text Specify name of entity to unfreeze Standard strings SET_SABER1 text Name of a saber in sabers.cfg to use in first hand.  \"none\" removes current saber Standard strings SET_SABER2 text Name of a saber in sabers.cfg to use in second hand.  \"none\" removes current saber Standard strings SET_PLAYERMODEL text Name of an NPC config in NPC2.cfg to use for this ent Standard strings SET_VEHICLE text Name of an vehicle config in vehicles.cfg to make this ent drive Standard strings SET_SCROLLTEXT text key of text string to print Standard strings SET_LCARSTEXT text key of text string to print in LCARS frame Standard strings SET_CENTERTEXT text key of text string to print in center of screen. vectors SET_ORIGIN vector Set origin explicitly or with TAG vectors SET_ANGLES vector Set angles explicitly or with TAG vectors SET_TELEPORT_DEST vector Set origin here as soon as the area is clear vectors SET_SABER_ORIGIN vector Removes this ent's saber from their hand, turns it off, and places it at the specified location floats SET_XVELOCITY number Velocity along X axis floats SET_YVELOCITY number Velocity along Y axis floats SET_ZVELOCITY number Velocity along Z axis floats SET_Z_OFFSET number Vertical offset from original origin... offset/ent's speed * 1000ms is duration floats SET_DPITCH number Pitch for NPC to turn to floats SET_DYAW number Yaw for NPC to turn to floats SET_TIMESCALE number Speed-up slow down game (0 - 1.0) floats SET_CAMERA_GROUP_Z_OFS text when following an ent with the camera, apply this z ofs floats SET_VISRANGE number How far away NPC can see floats SET_EARSHOT number How far an NPC can hear floats SET_VIGILANCE number How often to look for enemies (0 - 1.0) floats SET_GRAVITY number Change this ent's gravity - 800 default floats SET_FACEAUX number Set face to Aux expression for number of seconds floats SET_FACEBLINK number Set face to Blink expression for number of seconds floats SET_FACEBLINKFROWN number Set face to Blinkfrown expression for number of seconds floats SET_FACEFROWN number Set face to Frown expression for number of seconds floats SET_FACENORMAL number Set face to Normal expression for number of seconds floats SET_FACEEYESCLOSED number Set face to Eyes closed floats SET_FACEEYESOPENED number Set face to Eyes open floats SET_WAIT number Change an entity's wait field floats SET_FOLLOWDIST number How far away to stay from leader in BS_FOLLOW_LEADER floats SET_SCALE number Scale the entity model floats SET_RENDER_CULL_RADIUS number Used to ensure rendering for entities with geographically sprawling animations (world units) floats SET_DISTSQRD_TO_PLAYER number Only to be used in a 'get'. (Distance to player)*(Distance to player) ints SET_ANIM_HOLDTIME_LOWER whole number Hold lower anim for number of milliseconds ints SET_ANIM_HOLDTIME_UPPER whole number Hold upper anim for number of milliseconds ints SET_ANIM_HOLDTIME_BOTH whole number Hold lower and upper anims for number of milliseconds ints SET_HEALTH whole number Change health ints SET_ARMOR whole number Change armor ints SET_WALKSPEED whole number Change walkSpeed ints SET_RUNSPEED whole number Change runSpeed ints SET_YAWSPEED whole number Change yawSpeed ints SET_AGGRESSION whole number Change aggression 1-5 ints SET_AIM whole number Change aim 1-5 ints SET_FRICTION whole number Change ent's friction - 6 default ints SET_SHOOTDIST whole number How far the ent can shoot - 0 uses weapon ints SET_HFOV whole number Horizontal field of view ints SET_VFOV whole number Vertical field of view ints SET_DELAYSCRIPTTIME whole number How many milliseconds to wait before running delayscript ints SET_FORWARDMOVE whole number NPC move forward -127(back) to 127 ints SET_RIGHTMOVE whole number NPC move right -127(left) to 127 ints SET_STARTFRAME whole number frame to start animation sequence on ints SET_ENDFRAME whole number frame to end animation sequence on ints SET_ANIMFRAME whole number frame to set animation sequence to ints SET_COUNT whole number Change an entity's count field ints SET_SHOT_SPACING whole number Time between shots for an NPC - reset to defaults when changes weapon ints SET_MISSIONSTATUSTIME whole number Amount of time until Mission Status should be shown after death ints SET_WIDTH whole number Width of NPC bounding box. ints SET_SABER1BLADEON whole number Activate a specific blade of Saber 1 (0 - (MAX_BLADES - 1)). ints SET_SABER1BLADEOFF whole number Deactivate a specific blade of Saber 1 (0 - (MAX_BLADES - 1)). ints SET_SABER2BLADEON whole number Activate a specific blade of Saber 2 (0 - (MAX_BLADES - 1)). ints SET_SABER2BLADEOFF whole number Deactivate a specific blade of Saber 2 (0 - (MAX_BLADES - 1)). ints SET_DAMAGEENTITY whole number Damage this entity with set amount. booleans SET_IGNOREPAIN BOOL_TYPES Do not react to pain booleans SET_IGNOREENEMIES BOOL_TYPES Do not acquire enemies booleans SET_IGNOREALERTS BOOL_TYPES Do not get enemy set by allies in area(ambush) booleans SET_DONTSHOOT BOOL_TYPES Others won't shoot you booleans SET_NOTARGET BOOL_TYPES Others won't pick you as enemy booleans SET_DONTFIRE BOOL_TYPES Don't fire your weapon booleans SET_LOCKED_ENEMY BOOL_TYPES Keep current enemy until dead booleans SET_CROUCHED BOOL_TYPES Force NPC to crouch booleans SET_WALKING BOOL_TYPES Force NPC to move at walkSpeed booleans SET_RUNNING BOOL_TYPES Force NPC to move at runSpeed booleans SET_CHASE_ENEMIES BOOL_TYPES NPC will chase after enemies booleans SET_LOOK_FOR_ENEMIES BOOL_TYPES NPC will be on the lookout for enemies booleans SET_FACE_MOVE_DIR BOOL_TYPES NPC will face in the direction it's moving booleans SET_DONT_FLEE BOOL_TYPES NPC will not run from danger booleans SET_FORCED_MARCH BOOL_TYPES NPC will not move unless you aim at him booleans SET_UNDYING BOOL_TYPES Can take damage down to 1 but not die booleans SET_NOAVOID BOOL_TYPES Will not avoid other NPCs or architecture booleans SET_SOLID BOOL_TYPES Make yourself notsolid or solid booleans SET_PLAYER_USABLE BOOL_TYPES Can be activateby the player's \"use\" button booleans SET_LOOP_ANIM BOOL_TYPES For non-NPCs, loop your animation sequence booleans SET_INTERFACE BOOL_TYPES Player interface on/off booleans SET_SHIELDS BOOL_TYPES NPC has no shields (Borg do not adapt) booleans SET_INVISIBLE BOOL_TYPES Makes an NPC not solid and not visible booleans SET_VAMPIRE BOOL_TYPES Draws only in mirrors/portals booleans SET_FORCE_INVINCIBLE BOOL_TYPES Force Invincibility effect, also godmode booleans SET_GREET_ALLIES BOOL_TYPES Makes an NPC greet teammates booleans SET_VIDEO_FADE_IN BOOL_TYPES Makes video playback fade in booleans SET_VIDEO_FADE_OUT BOOL_TYPES Makes video playback fade out booleans SET_PLAYER_LOCKED BOOL_TYPES Makes it so player cannot move booleans SET_LOCK_PLAYER_WEAPONS BOOL_TYPES Makes it so player cannot switch weapons booleans SET_NO_IMPACT_DAMAGE BOOL_TYPES Stops this ent from taking impact damage booleans SET_NO_KNOCKBACK BOOL_TYPES Stops this ent from taking knockback from weapons booleans SET_ALT_FIRE BOOL_TYPES Force NPC to use altfire when shooting booleans SET_NO_RESPONSE BOOL_TYPES NPCs will do generic responses when this is on (usescripts override generic responses as well) booleans SET_INVINCIBLE BOOL_TYPES Completely unkillable booleans SET_NO_COMBAT_TALK BOOL_TYPES NPCs will not do their combat talking noises when this is on booleans SET_NO_ALERT_TALK BOOL_TYPES NPCs will not do their combat talking noises when this is on booleans SET_TREASONED BOOL_TYPES Player has turned on his own- scripts will stop, NPCs will turn on him and level changes load the brig booleans SET_DISABLE_SHADER_ANIM BOOL_TYPES Allows turning off an animating shader in a script booleans SET_SHADER_ANIM BOOL_TYPES Sets a shader with an image map to be under frame control booleans SET_SABERACTIVE BOOL_TYPES Turns saber on/off booleans SET_ADJUST_AREA_PORTALS BOOL_TYPES Only set this on things you move with script commands that you *want* to open/close area portals.  Default is off. booleans SET_DMG_BY_HEAVY_WEAP_ONLY BOOL_TYPES When true, only a heavy weapon class missile/laser can damage this ent. booleans SET_SHIELDED BOOL_TYPES When true, ion_cannon is shielded from any kind of damage. booleans SET_NO_GROUPS BOOL_TYPES This NPC cannot alert groups or be part of a group booleans SET_FIRE_WEAPON BOOL_TYPES Makes NPC will hold down the fire button, until this is set to false booleans SET_FIRE_WEAPON_NO_ANIM BOOL_TYPES NPC will hold down the fire button, but they won't play firing anim booleans SET_SAFE_REMOVE BOOL_TYPES NPC will remove only when it's safe (Player is not in PVS) booleans SET_BOBA_JET_PACK BOOL_TYPES Turn on/off Boba Fett's Jet Pack booleans SET_NO_MINDTRICK BOOL_TYPES Makes NPC immune to jedi mind-trick booleans SET_INACTIVE BOOL_TYPES in lieu of using a target_activate or target_deactivate booleans SET_FUNC_USABLE_VISIBLE BOOL_TYPES provides an alternate way of changing func_usable to be visible or not, DOES NOT AFFECT SOLID booleans SET_SECRET_AREA_FOUND BOOL_TYPES Increment secret areas found counter booleans SET_END_SCREENDISSOLVE BOOL_TYPES End of game dissolve into star background and credits booleans SET_USE_CP_NEAREST BOOL_TYPES NPCs will use their closest combat points, not try and find ones next to the player, or flank player booleans SET_MORELIGHT BOOL_TYPES NPC will have a minlight of 96 booleans SET_NO_FORCE BOOL_TYPES NPC will not be affected by force powers booleans SET_NO_FALLTODEATH BOOL_TYPES NPC will not scream and tumble and fall to hit death over large drops booleans SET_DISMEMBERABLE BOOL_TYPES NPC will not be dismemberable if you set this to false (default is true) booleans SET_NO_ACROBATICS BOOL_TYPES Jedi won't jump, roll or cartwheel booleans SET_USE_SUBTITLES BOOL_TYPES When true NPC will always display subtitle regardless of subtitle setting booleans SET_CLEAN_DAMAGING_ENTS BOOL_TYPES Removes entities that could muck up cinematics, explosives, turrets, seekers. booleans SET_HUD BOOL_TYPES Turns on/off HUD booleans SET_NO_PVS_CULL BOOL_TYPES This entity will *always* be drawn - use only for special case cinematic NPCs that have anims that cover multiple rooms!!! booleans SET_CLOAK BOOL_TYPES Set a Saboteur to cloak (true) or un-cloak (false). booleans SET_FORCE_HEAL BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to start force healing at whatever level of force heal they have booleans SET_FORCE_SPEED BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to start force speeding at whatever level of force speed they have (may not do anything for NPCs?) booleans SET_FORCE_PUSH BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to do a force push at whatever level of force push they have - will not fail booleans SET_FORCE_PUSH_FAKE BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to do a force push anim, sound and effect, will not push anything booleans SET_FORCE_PULL BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to do a force push at whatever level of force push they have - will not fail booleans SET_FORCE_MIND_TRICK BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to do a jedi mind trick at whatever level of mind trick they have (may not do anything for NPCs?) booleans SET_FORCE_GRIP BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to grip their enemy at whatever level of grip they have (will grip until scripted to stop) booleans SET_FORCE_LIGHTNING BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to lightning at whatever level of lightning they have (will lightning until scripted to stop) booleans SET_FORCE_SABERTHROW BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to throw their saber at whatever level of saber throw they have (will throw saber until scripted to stop) booleans SET_FORCE_RAGE BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to go into force rage at whatever level of force rage they have booleans SET_FORCE_PROTECT BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to start a force protect at whatever level of force protect they have booleans SET_FORCE_ABSORB BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to do start a force absorb at whatever level of force absorb they have booleans SET_FORCE_DRAIN BOOL_TYPES Causes this ent to start force draining their enemy at whatever level of force drain they have (will drain until scripted to stop) booleans SET_WINTER_GEAR BOOL_TYPES Set the player to wear his/her winter gear (skins torso_g1 and lower_e1), or restore the default skins. booleans SET_NO_ANGLES BOOL_TYPES This NPC/player will not have any bone angle overrides or pitch or roll (should only be used in cinematics) calls SET_SKILL - Cannot set this, only get it - valid values are 0 through 3 Special tables SET_ANIM_UPPER ANIM_NAMES Torso and head anim Special tables SET_ANIM_LOWER ANIM_NAMES Legs anim Special tables SET_ANIM_BOTH ANIM_NAMES Set same anim on torso and legs Special tables SET_PLAYER_TEAM TEAM_NAMES Your team Special tables SET_ENEMY_TEAM TEAM_NAMES Team in which to look for enemies Special tables SET_BEHAVIOR_STATE BSTATE_STRINGS Change current bState Special tables SET_DEFAULT_BSTATE BSTATE_STRINGS Change fallback bState Special tables SET_TEMP_BSTATE BSTATE_STRINGS Set/Chang a temp bState Special tables SET_EVENT EVENT_NAMES Events you can initiate Special tables SET_WEAPON WEAPON_NAMES Change/Stow/Drop weapon Special tables SET_ITEM ITEM_NAMES Give items Special tables SET_MUSIC_STATE MUSIC_STATES Set the state of the dynamic music Special tables SET_FORCE_HEAL_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_JUMP_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_SPEED_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_PUSH_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_PULL_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_MINDTRICK_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_GRIP_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_LIGHTNING_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_SABER_THROW FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_SABER_DEFENSE FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_SABER_OFFENSE SABER_STYLES Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_RAGE_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_PROTECT_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_ABSORB_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_DRAIN_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_FORCE_SIGHT_LEVEL FORCE_LEVELS Change force power level Special tables SET_SABER1_COLOR1 SABER_COLORS Set color of first blade of first saber Special tables SET_SABER1_COLOR2 SABER_COLORS Set color of second blade of first saber Special tables SET_SABER2_COLOR1 SABER_COLORS Set color of first blade of first saber Special tables SET_SABER2_COLOR2 SABER_COLORS Set color of second blade of first saber Special tables SET_DISMEMBER_LIMB HIT_LOCATIONS Cut off a part of a body and send the limb flying Special tables SET_OBJECTIVE_SHOW OBJECTIVES Show objective on mission screen Special tables SET_OBJECTIVE_HIDE OBJECTIVES Hide objective from mission screen Special tables SET_OBJECTIVE_SUCCEEDED OBJECTIVES Mark objective as completed Special tables SET_OBJECTIVE_SUCCEEDED_NO_UPDATE OBJECTIVES Mark objective as completed, no update sent to screen Special tables SET_OBJECTIVE_FAILED OBJECTIVES Mark objective as failed Special tables SET_MISSIONFAILED MISSIONFAILED Mission failed screen activates Special tables SET_TACTICAL_SHOW TACTICAL Show tactical info on mission objectives screen Special tables SET_TACTICAL_HIDE TACTICAL Hide tactical info on mission objectives screen Special tables SET_OBJECTIVE_CLEARALL - Force all objectives to be hidden Special tables SET_OBJECTIVE_LIGHTSIDE - Used to get whether the player has chosen the light (succeeded) or dark (failed) side. Special tables SET_MISSIONSTATUSTEXT STATUSTEXT Text to appear in mission status screen Special tables SET_MENU_SCREEN MENUSCREENS Brings up specified menu screen Special tables SET_CLOSINGCREDITS - Show closing credits Special tables SET_LEAN LEAN_TYPES Lean left, right or stop leaning"},{"p":"befehle.html","a":"ausdruecke","t":"Every command","s":"Expressions: get, tag, random","x":"Instead of a fixed value, a field can hold an expression. In the editor, 助手 builds them: Get - get ( FLOAT, \"name\" ) reads a variable declared with declare. Tag - tag ( \"cam_door\", ORIGIN ) takes the position (or ANGLES) of a ref_tag on the map. That is how cameras stand on marks. Rnd - random ( 1000, 3000 ) a random number between two values, for example a wait."}];
